msgid "PES generators"
msgstr "势能面生成器"

msgid "POTENTIAL ENERGY SURFACES (XSURF)"
msgstr "势能面（XSURF）"

msgid "with"
msgstr "\\ 其中"

msgid ""
"\\begin{eqnarray*}\n"
"V_i(q_i) & = & V_i^0(q_i) - V(0) \\\\\n"
"V_{ij}(q_i,q_j) & = & V_{ij}^0(q_i,q_j) - \\sum_{r\\in\\{i,j\\}} V_r(q_r) - V(0) \\\\\n"
"V_{ijk}(q_i,q_j,q_k) & = & V_{ijk}^0(q_i,q_j,q_k) - \\sum_{\\stackrel{\\scriptstyle r,s\\in\\{i,j,k\\}}{r>s}} V_{rs}(q_r,q_s) - \\sum_{r\\in\\{i,j,k\\}} V_r(q_r) - V(0)\\\\\n"
"V_{ijkl}(q_i,q_j,q_k,q_l) & = & \\dots\n"
"\\label{diff4}\\end{eqnarray*}"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{eqnarray*}\n"
"V_i(q_i) & = & V_i^0(q_i) - V(0) \\\\\n"
"V_{ij}(q_i,q_j) & = & V_{ij}^0(q_i,q_j) - \\sum_{r\\in\\{i,j\\}} V_r(q_r) - V(0) \\\\\n"
"V_{ijk}(q_i,q_j,q_k) & = & V_{ijk}^0(q_i,q_j,q_k) - \\sum_{\\stackrel{\\scriptstyle r,s\\in\\{i,j,k\\}}{r>s}} V_{rs}(q_r,q_s) - \\sum_{r\\in\\{i,j,k\\}} V_r(q_r) - V(0)\\\\\n"
"V_{ijkl}(q_i,q_j,q_k,q_l) & = & \\dots\n"
"\\label{diff4}\\end{eqnarray*}"

msgid ""
"As the elongations along different coordinates within the build-up of the "
"PES will lead to different molecular point groups for the individual "
"electronic structure calculations, any symmetry-specific information in that"
" part of the input needs to be avoided. The ``XSURF`` program is based on an"
" iterative algorithm, i.e. grid points will be added automatically to the "
"grid representation of the potential until a convergence threshold will be "
"met. This guarantees a well-balanced description of the different terms in "
"the expansion of the potential and simultaneously minimizes the number of "
"*ab initio* calculations for a representation of the potential. For further "
"details see:"
msgstr ""
"由于在构建势能面过程中沿不同坐标的伸长将导致各个电子结构计算具有不同的分子点群，因此需要避免在该部分输入中包含任何与对称性相关的特定信息。\\ "
"``XSURF`` "
"程序基于迭代算法，即网格点将自动添加到势能的网格表示中，直至满足收敛阈值。这保证了势能展开式中各项的均衡描述，同时最小化了用于表示势能所需的\\ "
"*从头计算*\\ 次数。更多细节请参阅："

msgid "Options"
msgstr "选项"

msgid "The following *options* are available:"
msgstr "以下\\ *选项*\\ 可用："

msgid "Intensities"
msgstr "强度"

msgid ""
"The ``INTENSITY`` directive of the ``XSURF`` program provides options for "
"controlling the calculations of property surfaces as needed for the "
"calculation of intensities. Currently, dipole surfaces (infrared "
"intensities), polarizability tensor surfaces (Raman intensities) and "
"quadrupole tensor surfaces are supported. The calculation of dipole surfaces"
" can be combined with the calculation of polarizability or quadrupole "
"surfaces, but the latter two exclude each other. Property surfaces can be "
"computed for all those methods for which analytical expressions are "
"available in Molpro. Considering dipole surfaces for the calculation of "
"infrared intensities, for all methods except Hartree-Fock this requires the "
"keyword ``CPHF,1`` after the keyword for the electronic structure method. In"
" multi-level schemes for which the variables ``VAR1D``, ``VAR2D`` and "
"``VAR3D`` are set individually, the VARDIP\\ *n*\\ D[X,Y,Z] variables have "
"to be set accordingly. The determination of dipole surfaces beyond Hartree-"
"Fock quality effectively doubles the computation time for surface "
"calculations."
msgstr ""
"``XSURF`` 程序的 ``INTENSITY`` "
"指令提供了控制性质曲面计算的选项，这些计算是计算强度所必需的。目前支持偶极矩曲面（红外强度）、极化率张量曲面（拉曼强度）和四极矩张量曲面。偶极矩曲面的计算可以与极化率或四极矩曲面的计算相结合，但后两者相互排斥。性质曲面可以为所有在"
" Molpro 中具有解析表达式的方法进行计算。考虑到用于计算红外强度的偶极矩曲面，对于除 Hartree-Fock "
"外的所有方法，这需要在电子结构方法的关键字后加上关键字 ``CPHF,1``\\ 。在变量 ``VAR1D``\\ 、\\ ``VAR2D`` 和 "
"``VAR3D`` 被单独设置的多级方案中，VARDIP\\ *n*\\ D[X,Y,Z] 变量必须相应地进行设置。确定超越 Hartree-Fock "
"质量的偶极矩曲面，实际上会使曲面计算的计算时间加倍。"

msgid ""
"An example for a calculation, which provides both, infrared and Raman "
"intensities, is given below."
msgstr "下面给出了一个同时提供红外和拉曼强度的计算示例。"

msgid "A calculation for quadrupole intensities would require an input like"
msgstr "四极矩强度的计算需要如下输入："

msgid "Restart capabilities"
msgstr "重启功能"

msgid ""
"As ``XSURF`` calculations are very demanding it is highly recommended to "
"dump the grid representation of the potential to disk. This allows for "
"convenient restarts for subsequent vibrational structure calculations. Note,"
" that restarts can also be performed for incomplete potentials."
msgstr ""
"由于 ``XSURF`` 计算非常耗时，强烈建议将势能的网格表示转储到磁盘。这便于后续振动结构计算的重启。请注意，对于不完整的势能也可以执行重启。"

msgid "Taylor expansions"
msgstr "泰勒展开"

msgid ""
"By default, the ``XSURF`` program generates an :math:`n`-mode expansion. "
"However, the program structure allows also to retrieve a Taylor expansion of"
" the potential, which is identical with a Taylor expansion obtained by "
"differentiation. In principal Taylor expansions of arbitrary order can be "
"generated, but of course it must be guaranteed that the order of coupling "
"terms is sufficiently high, e.g. a sextic force field cannot be obtained "
"from a ``NDIM``\\ =4 calculation, because this calculation generates "
"coupling terms with at most 4 different indices. In such a case, the missing"
" terms will simply be neglected."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，\\ ``XSURF`` 程序生成一个 :math:`n` "
"模展开。然而，程序结构也允许获取势能的泰勒展开，这与通过微分获得的泰勒展开相同。原则上可以生成任意阶的泰勒展开，但当然必须保证耦合项的阶数足够高，例如，六次力场无法从"
" ``NDIM``\\ =4 的计算中获得，因为该计算最多生成具有 4 个不同索引的耦合项。在这种情况下，缺失的项将被简单地忽略。"

msgid ""
"``TYPE``\\ =\\ ``QFF`` (corresponds to ``POINTS``\\ =5 and ``ORDER``\\ =5) "
"specifies a full quartic force field."
msgstr "``TYPE``\\ =\\ ``QFF`` (对应于 ``POINTS``\\ =5 和 ``ORDER``\\ =5) 指定一个完整的四次力场。"

msgid ""
"``TYPE``\\ =\\ ``SQFF`` specifies a semi-quartic force field (as used in "
"VPT2 calculations)."
msgstr "``TYPE``\\ =\\ ``SQFF`` 指定一个半四次力场（用于 VPT2 计算）。"

msgid ""
"``TYPE``\\ =\\ ``SEXTIC`` (corresponds to ``POINTS``\\ =7 and ``ORDER``\\ "
"=7) is the shortcut for a sextic force field."
msgstr "``TYPE``\\ =\\ ``SEXTIC`` (对应于 ``POINTS``\\ =7 和 ``ORDER``\\ =7) 是六次力场的快捷方式。"

msgid "Multi-level calculations"
msgstr "多级计算"

msgid ""
"The level of the electronic structure calculations can be changed for the "
"different :math:`i`-body terms in the expansion of the potential. As a "
"consequence, the keywords ``START2D``, ``START3D``, ``VAR2D`` and ``VAR3D`` "
"exist in full analogy to the keywords ``START1D`` and ``VAR1D`` in standard "
"calculations (see above). The number always represents the level of the "
"expansion term. Such calculations are termed multi-level calculations. There"
" does *not* exist a corresponding set of keywords for the 4-body terms. "
"4-body terms will always use the variables specified for the 3-body terms "
"(this restriction is lifted in the ``XSURF`` program."
msgstr ""
"对于势能展开式中不同的 :math:`i`-体项，可以改变电子结构计算的水平。因此，关键词 ``START2D``\\ 、\\ "
"``START3D``\\ 、\\ ``VAR2D`` 和 ``VAR3D`` 与标准计算中的关键词 ``START1D`` 和 ``VAR1D`` "
"完全类似（见上文）。数字始终代表展开项的水平。此类计算称为多水平计算。对于4体项，\\ *不*\\ "
"存在对应的关键词集。4体项将始终使用为3体项指定的变量（此限制在 ``XSURF`` 程序中已取消）。"

msgid ""
"In 2D and 4D calculations (i.e. ``NDIM=2,4``) the ``VMULT`` command can be "
"used as well. In 4D calculations the last level must always be identical to "
"the 3D level. In 2D the meaning of ``MULTI=1`` and ``MULTI=3`` is the same. "
"Likewise, ``MULTI=2`` and ``MULTI=4`` are the same in case of 2D "
"calculations. ``START2D`` and ``START3D`` define labels in the input stream "
"in order to compute the 2D and 3D terms at different levels of electronic "
"structure theory than the 1D terms. The use of the ``START2D`` and "
"``START3D`` commands usually requests the use of ``GOTO`` commands in the "
"input. The keywords ``VAR2D`` and ``VAR3D`` are defined in full analogy to "
"the ``VAR1D`` option. They specify the internal variable (e.g. ENERGY, EMP2,"
" CCSD, ...) to be read out for a given grid point."
msgstr ""
"在二维和四维计算中（即 ``NDIM=2,4``\\ ），同样可以使用 ``VMULT`` "
"命令。在四维计算中，最后一个层级必须始终与三维层级相同。在二维计算中，\\ ``MULTI=1`` 和 ``MULTI=3`` "
"的含义相同。同样地，在二维计算中，\\ ``MULTI=2`` 和 ``MULTI=4`` 也相同。\\ ``START2D`` 和 "
"``START3D`` 定义了输入流中的标签，以便在与一维项不同的电子结构理论层级上计算二维和三维项。使用 ``START2D`` 和 "
"``START3D`` 命令通常要求在输入中使用 ``GOTO`` 命令。关键字 ``VAR2D`` 和 ``VAR3D`` 的定义与 "
"``VAR1D`` 选项完全类似。它们指定了针对给定网格点要读取的内部变量（例如 ENERGY、EMP2、CCSD 等）。"

msgid ""
"The following example shows a 1D:CCSD(T)/cc-pVTZ; 2D:MP4(SDQ)/cc-pVTZ and "
"3D:MP2/cc-pVTZ multi-level calculation. As the MP2 energy is a byproduct of "
"the CCSD(T) and MP4(SDQ) calculations only the 1D grid points will be "
"computed twice (at the CCSD(T) and MP4(SDQ) levels). The 1D and 2D energies "
"will be obtained from the internal variable ``ENERGY`` while the 3D energies"
" make use of the ``EMP2`` variable."
msgstr ""
"以下示例展示了一个 1D:CCSD(T)/cc-pVTZ；2D:MP4(SDQ)/cc-pVTZ 和 3D:MP2/cc-pVTZ 的多层级计算。由于 "
"MP2 能量是 CCSD(T) 和 MP4(SDQ) 计算的副产品，因此只有一维网格点会被计算两次（分别在 CCSD(T) 和 MP4(SDQ) "
"层级）。一维和二维能量将从内部变量 ``ENERGY`` 获取，而三维能量则使用 ``EMP2`` 变量。"

msgid ""
"However, if you need a more specialized multi-level scheme, ``XSURF`` "
"provides an expert mode. Within this you can for example change the method "
"for 3D and 4D terms. When calculating an ab initio point for an :math:`n` "
"dimensional body term, two aspects need to be considered. First, you may "
"check whether information for higher-order terms can be retrieved from low-"
"order terms, e.g. the MP2 energy is a byproduct of a CCSD calculation. "
"Second, if the information cannot be retrieved, single-point calculations at"
" different electronic structure levels may be repeated for the low-order "
"terms. All this information is internally stored in a matrix."
msgstr ""
"然而，如果您需要更专业的多层级方案，\\ ``XSURF`` 提供了一个专家模式。在此模式下，您可以更改三维和四维项的方法。当为 :math:`n` "
"维体项计算一个从头计算点时，需要考虑两个方面。首先，您可以检查是否可以从低阶项中检索到高阶项的信息，例如 MP2 能量是 CCSD "
"计算的副产品。其次，如果无法检索到信息，则可能需要对低阶项在不同电子结构层级上重复进行单点计算。所有这些信息都内部存储在一个矩阵中。"

msgid ""
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"M&=&\\left(\\begin{array}{cccc}\n"
"1&0&-1&1\\\\\n"
"0&1&-2&1\\\\\n"
"0&0&1&1\\\\\n"
"0&0&0&1\n"
"\\end{array}\\right)\\end{aligned}"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"M&=&\\left(\\begin{array}{cccc}\n"
"1&0&-1&1\\\\\n"
"0&1&-2&1\\\\\n"
"0&0&1&1\\\\\n"
"0&0&0&1\n"
"\\end{array}\\right)\\end{aligned}"

msgid ""
"The columns of the matrix belong to the method and the lines to the "
"dimension. The only important numbers are therefore the upper diagonals. A "
":math:`1` means calculate something and a number smaller than one, that the "
"information is somewhere available. This matrix is an example for the "
"following set of methods:"
msgstr ""
"\\ 矩阵的列属于方法，行属于维度。因此，唯一重要的数字是上对角线。\\ :math:`1` 表示需要计算某些内容，而小于 1 "
"的数字表示该信息在某个地方可用。此矩阵是以下方法集的一个示例："

msgid "For the other multi cases (see above) the matrix elements look like:"
msgstr "对于其他多层级情况（见上文），矩阵元如下所示："

msgid ""
"M=\\left(\\begin{array}{ccc}\n"
"1&1&1\\\\\n"
"0&1&1\\\\\n"
"0&0&1\n"
"\\end{array}\\right)"
msgstr ""
"M=\\left(\\begin{array}{ccc}\n"
"1&1&1\\\\\n"
"0&1&1\\\\\n"
"0&0&1\n"
"\\end{array}\\right)"

msgid ""
"M_1=\\left(\\begin{array}{ccc}\n"
"1&0&-1\\\\\n"
"0&1&-2\\\\\n"
"0&0&1\n"
"\\end{array}\\right); \\qquad\n"
"M_2=\\left(\\begin{array}{ccc}\n"
"1&-1&0\\\\\n"
"0&1&0\\\\\n"
"0&0&1\n"
"\\end{array}\\right)"
msgstr ""
"M_1=\\left(\\begin{array}{ccc}\n"
"1&0&-1\\\\\n"
"0&1&-2\\\\\n"
"0&0&1\n"
"\\end{array}\\right); \\qquad\n"
"M_2=\\left(\\begin{array}{ccc}\n"
"1&-1&0\\\\\n"
"0&1&0\\\\\n"
"0&0&1\n"
"\\end{array}\\right)"

msgid ""
"M_1=\\left(\\begin{array}{ccc}\n"
"1&1&-2\\\\\n"
"0&1&-2\\\\\n"
"0&0&1\n"
"\\end{array}\\right); \\qquad\n"
"M_2=\\left(\\begin{array}{ccc}\n"
"1&1&0\\\\\n"
"0&1&0\\\\\n"
"0&0&1\n"
"\\end{array}\\right)"
msgstr ""
"M_1=\\left(\\begin{array}{ccc}\n"
"1&1&-2\\\\\n"
"0&1&-2\\\\\n"
"0&0&1\n"
"\\end{array}\\right); \\qquad\n"
"M_2=\\left(\\begin{array}{ccc}\n"
"1&1&0\\\\\n"
"0&1&0\\\\\n"
"0&0&1\n"
"\\end{array}\\right)"

msgid ""
"M_1=\\left(\\begin{array}{ccc}\n"
"1&0&1\\\\\n"
"0&1&1\\\\\n"
"0&0&1\n"
"\\end{array}\\right); \\qquad\n"
"M_2=\\left(\\begin{array}{ccc}\n"
"1&-1&1\\\\\n"
"0&1&1\\\\\n"
"0&0&1\n"
"\\end{array}\\right)"
msgstr ""
"M_1=\\left(\\begin{array}{ccc}\n"
"1&0&1\\\\\n"
"0&1&1\\\\\n"
"0&0&1\n"
"\\end{array}\\right); \\qquad\n"
"M_2=\\left(\\begin{array}{ccc}\n"
"1&-1&1\\\\\n"
"0&1&1\\\\\n"
"0&0&1\n"
"\\end{array}\\right)"

msgid ""
"These expert multi level matrices can be set by ``MMAT(x,y)``\\ =\\ *n*. "
"Only non-zero elements need to be set."
msgstr "这些专家级多层级矩阵可通过 ``MMAT(x,y)``\\ =\\ *n* 设置。仅需设置非零元素。"

msgid "Linear combinations of normal coordinates"
msgstr "简正坐标的线性组合"

msgid ""
"The ``LINCOMB`` directive allows for the calculation of linear combinations "
"of normal coordinates for the expansion of the potential. This is realized "
"by 2x2 Jacobi rotations. At most 3N-6/2 rotations can be provided in the "
"input."
msgstr ""
"``LINCOMB`` 指令允许计算简正坐标的线性组合以展开势能。这是通过 2x2 Jacobi 旋转实现的。输入中最多可提供 3N-6/2 个旋转。"

msgid "Scaling of individual normal coordinates"
msgstr "单个简正坐标的缩放"

msgid ""
"The ``SCALNM`` directive allows for the scaling with respect to the "
"individual normal coordinates or an automated scaling of all of them. This "
"is the recommended choice for potentials dominated by quartic rather than "
"quadratic terms. At most 3N-6 individual scale factors and shift parameters "
"can be provided. In particular the ``AUTO`` option was found to be very "
"helpful in practical applications."
msgstr ""
"``SCALNM`` 指令允许对各个简正坐标进行缩放或对所有坐标进行自动缩放。对于由四次项而非二次项主导的势能，这是推荐的选择。最多可以提供 3N-6 "
"个单独的缩放因子和位移参数。特别是 ``AUTO`` 选项在实际应用中被发现非常有帮助。"

msgid ""
"The ``SCALIC`` directive allows for the scaling with respect to the "
"individual internal coordinates or an automated scaling of all of them."
msgstr "``SCALIC`` 指令允许对单个内坐标进行标度，或对所有内坐标进行自动标度。"

msgid "Fit Functions"
msgstr "拟合函数"

msgid ""
"A fit function has to be defined for each coordinate. These fit functions "
"are used as an intermediate fit to generate a fine grid representation of "
"the potential energy surface. The fit functions can be defined either by the"
" user or automatically via cross-validation. If no electronic structure "
"level for the cross-validation is provided by the user, polynomials are used"
" as a default. This directive also exists in the ``POLY`` program. If no fit"
" functions are defined within the ``XSURF`` program, but in the ``POLY`` "
"program, the fit functions of the ``POLY`` program are also used in the "
"``XSURF`` program."
msgstr ""
"必须为每个坐标定义一个拟合函数。这些拟合函数用作中间拟合，以生成势能面的细网格表示。拟合函数可以由用户定义，也可以通过交叉验证自动定义。如果用户没有为交叉验证提供电子结构级别，则默认使用多项式。该指令也存在于"
" ``POLY`` 程序中。如果在 ``XSURF`` 程序中没有定义拟合函数，但在 ``POLY`` 程序中定义了，则 ``POLY`` "
"程序中的拟合函数也会在 ``XSURF`` 程序中使用。"

msgid "Point Selection"
msgstr "点选择"

msgid ""
"The positioning of the ab initio single points along a coordinate can be "
"controlled by this directive. The default is currently an empirically fixed "
"distribution. Alternatively one can use a positioning based on Gaussian "
"process regression."
msgstr "沿坐标的从头计算单点的位置可以通过此指令控制。默认值目前是一个经验固定的分布。或者，可以使用基于高斯过程回归的定位方法。"

msgid "Calculation of normal coordinates"
msgstr "简正坐标的计算"

msgid "Visualization and interfaces"
msgstr "可视化与接口"

msgid ""
"The ``GRAPH`` directive is the interface to programs for visualizing "
"potential terms and to provide potential information for any other programs "
"in a most simple manner."
msgstr "``GRAPH`` 指令是用于可视化势能项以及以最简单方式为任何其他程序提供势能信息的接口。"

msgid "Modeling of high-order n-body terms"
msgstr "高阶 n-体项的建模"

msgid ""
"Within the framework of multi-level calculations (see the directive "
"``VMULT``), 3D and 4D terms can be modeled. The modeling scheme is based on "
"a reparametrization of the semiempirical AM1 method. Consequently, in the "
"input stream the energy variable to be read in must refer to a semiempirical"
" calculation. After the 2D terms the program optimizes the semiempirical "
"parameters in order to represent the 1D and 2D surfaces best."
msgstr ""
"在多级计算框架内（参见指令 ``VMULT``\\ ），可以对 3D 和 4D 项进行建模。该建模方案基于半经验 AM1 "
"方法的重新参数化。因此，在输入流中，要读取的能量变量必须引用半经验计算。在 2D 项之后，程序会优化半经验参数，以最佳地表示 1D 和 2D 势能面。"

msgid ""
"The following example shows the input for a surface calculation in which the"
" 3D terms will be modeled."
msgstr "以下示例展示了一个势能面计算的输入，其中 3D 项将被建模。"

msgid "Error correction schemes"
msgstr "误差校正方案"

msgid ""
"The ``ALTER`` directive of the ``XSURF`` program allows to apply error "
"correction schemes for individual single point calculations. For example, in"
" case that the Hartree Fock calculation for a certain grid point did not "
"converge and the ``ORBITAL`` directive in the subsequent electron "
"correlation calculation uses the ``IGNORE_ERROR`` option, an alternative "
"calculation scheme can be provided, e.g. MCSCF in contrast to RHF. It allows"
" to apply error correction schemes for individual single point calculations."
" For example, in case that the Hartree Fock calculation for a certain grid "
"point did not converge and the ``ORBITAL`` directive in the subsequent "
"electron correlation calculation uses the ``IGNORE_ERROR`` option, an "
"alternative calculation scheme can be provided, e.g. MCSCF in contrast to "
"RHF. The ``ALTER`` directive always requests to specify a new label, which "
"replaces the old one. If more than one label shall be replaced, the "
"``ALTER`` directive needs to be called repeatedly."
msgstr ""
"``XSURF`` 程序的 ``ALTER`` 指令允许对单个单点计算应用误差校正方案。例如，如果某个网格点的 Hartree Fock "
"计算未收敛，并且后续电子相关计算中的 ``ORBITAL`` 指令使用了 ``IGNORE_ERROR`` 选项，则可以提供一个替代的计算方案，例如使用"
" MCSCF 而非 RHF。它允许对单个单点计算应用误差校正方案。例如，如果某个网格点的 Hartree Fock 计算未收敛，并且后续电子相关计算中的"
" ``ORBITAL`` 指令使用了 ``IGNORE_ERROR`` 选项，则可以提供一个替代的计算方案，例如使用 MCSCF 而非 RHF。\\ "
"``ALTER`` 指令总是要求指定一个新的标签来替换旧的标签。如果要替换多个标签，则需要重复调用 ``ALTER`` 指令。"

msgid ""
"Note that DFT calculations often still converge when RHF calculations "
"already fail to do so. The following example demonstrates the use of the "
"``ALTER`` directive within a multi-level PES calculation. In case that the "
"RHF calculation for the 1D or 2D terms does not converge, this will be "
"recognized by the UCCSD(T)-F12a calculations. The option "
"``orbital,ignore_error=2`` prevents a termination of Molpro and the programs"
" tries to enforce convergence by the recipe specified below ``label5``."
msgstr ""
"请注意，当RHF计算已经无法收敛时，DFT计算通常仍能收敛。以下示例演示了在多级势能面计算中使用\\ ``ALTER``\\ "
"指令。如果1D或2D项的RHF计算未收敛，UCCSD(T)-F12a计算将识别到这一点。选项\\ "
"``orbital,ignore_error=2``\\ 可防止Molpro终止，程序将尝试通过\\ ``label5``\\ 下方指定的方案强制收敛。"

msgid "Deleting individual surfaces"
msgstr "删除单个势能面"

msgid "``DELETE``,\\ *i*,\\ *j*"
msgstr "``DELETE``,\\ *i*,\\ *j*"

msgid "deletes the 2D surface :math:`ij`"
msgstr "删除二维势能面 :math:`ij`"

msgid "``DELETE``,\\ *i*,\\ *j*,\\ *k*"
msgstr "``DELETE``,\\ *i*,\\ *j*,\\ *k*"

msgid "deletes the 3D surface :math:`ijk`"
msgstr "删除三维曲面 :math:`ijk`"

msgid "``DELETE``,\\ *i*,\\ *j*,\\ *k*,\\ *l*"
msgstr "``DELETE``,\\ *i*,\\ *j*,\\ *k*,\\ *l*"

msgid "deletes the 4D surface :math:`ijkl`"
msgstr "删除四维曲面 :math:`ijkl`"

msgid "Selection of Modes"
msgstr "模式选择"

msgid ""
"The ``VIBMODE`` directive allows to span the PES only with predefined modes."
" The following options can be combined in various ways."
msgstr "``VIBMODE`` 指令允许仅使用预定义的模式来展开势能面。以下选项可以多种方式组合使用。"

msgid "Interface to other programs"
msgstr "与其他程序的接口"

msgid ""
"The ``INTERFACE`` directive allows for the communication with other "
"programs. It writes information about the individual grid points of a PES to"
" an external ASCII file, which can be processed by other software. <!-- "
"Likewise, files in the same structure with additional information from "
"external programs can be read in. After reading in all data points, the date"
" points will be transformed into a fine grid and fitted to polynomials.-->"
msgstr ""
"``INTERFACE`` 指令允许与其他程序通信。它将势能面上各个网格点的信息写入外部 ASCII 文件，供其他软件处理。<!– "
"同样，可以读入具有相同结构、包含外部程序附加信息的文件。读入所有数据点后，数据点将被转换为细网格并拟合为多项式。–>"

msgid ""
"<!--  \\* **``COPY``\\ =\\ *n*** (=0 Default) Once new data have been "
"generated in the external ASCII file, the coefficients of the corresponding "
"polynomials can be displayed in the ``POLY`` program using the option "
"``COEF_INTERFACEx`` with (x=1,2...). It is also possible to replace the "
"energy or dipole surfaces generated by Molpro by these new quantities by "
"``COPY=ENE`` or ``COPY=DIP``. -->"
msgstr ""
"<!– \\* ``COPY`` **=\\ n** (=0 默认值) 一旦在外部 ASCII 文件中生成了新数据，相应多项式的系数可以通过选项 "
"``COEF_INTERFACEx`` (x=1,2…) 在 ``POLY`` 程序中显示。也可以通过 ``COPY=ENE`` 或 "
"``COPY=DIP`` 用这些新量替换 Molpro 生成的能量或偶极矩曲面。–>"

msgid ""
"<!--  \\* **``TYPE``\\ =\\ *variable*** (=OUT Default) This option controls,"
" if the file shall be written ``TYPE=OUT`` or read in ``TYPE=IN``. -->"
msgstr ""
"<!– \\* ``COPY`` **=\\ n** (=0 默认值) 一旦在外部 ASCII 文件中生成了新数据，相应多项式的系数可以通过选项 "
"``COEF_INTERFACEx`` (x=1,2…) 在 ``POLY`` 程序中显示。也可以通过 ``COPY=ENE`` 或 "
"``COPY=DIP`` 用这些新量替换 Molpro 生成的能量或偶极矩曲面。–>"

msgid "Grid Computing"
msgstr "网格计算"

msgid ""
"To generate a potential energy surface with the grid computing interface, "
"follow these steps:"
msgstr "要使用网格计算接口生成势能面，请遵循以下步骤："

msgid ""
"Run a Molpro calculation on the master control file (see the example above) "
"to generate the control files for the individual single points."
msgstr "在主控制文件上运行 Molpro 计算（参见上例），以生成各个单点的控制文件。"

msgid ""
"Use the generated xgridcomp.sh to run the individual single point "
"calculations."
msgstr "使用生成的 xgridcomp.sh 来运行各个单点计算。"

msgid ""
"Increase the ``loop`` option to 1, read in the generated \\*.pot file (using"
" the ``EXTERN`` command) and dump to a new \\*.pot file, e.g. ethene_2.pot."
msgstr ""
"将 ``loop`` 选项增加到 1，读入生成的 \\*.pot 文件（使用 ``EXTERN`` 命令）并转储到一个新的 \\*.pot 文件，例如 "
"ethene_2.pot。"

msgid ""
"Repeat the last steps until all single point calculations have been "
"performed."
msgstr "重复最后几步，直到所有单点计算都已完成。"

msgid "Extending existing potentials"
msgstr "扩展现有势能面"

msgid "Quality Check"
msgstr "质量检查"

msgid ""
"The ``CHECK`` directive of the ``XSURF`` program allows for a quality check "
"of a completed surface. This routine simply computes the exact *ab initio* "
"energies at randomly selected grid points and compares these values with the"
" interpolated ones, which will be used subsequently for the determination of"
" the wavefunction. This program is fully parallelized."
msgstr ""
"``XSURF`` 程序的 ``CHECK`` 指令允许对已完成的曲面进行质量检查。此例程仅计算在随机选择的网格点处的精确 *从头计算* "
"能量，并将这些值与后续用于确定波函数的插值值进行比较。该程序完全并行化。"

msgid "Additional properties"
msgstr "附加性质"

msgid ""
"The ``XSURF`` programs allows to compute energy surfaces, dipole surfaces "
"and polarizability surfaces. In addition to that, arbitrary property "
"surfaces can be generated and dumped into an external restart file."
msgstr "``XSURF`` 程序允许计算势能面、偶极矩曲面和极化率曲面。除此之外，还可以生成任意的性质曲面并转储到外部重启文件中。"

msgid ""
"The ``XSURF`` programs allows to compute the desired surfaces with the use "
"of internal coordinates."
msgstr "``XSURF`` 程序允许使用内坐标计算所需的曲面。"

msgid "zmat: Zmatrix coordinates (need to be provided via the Input geometry)"
msgstr "zmat: Z矩阵坐标（需要通过输入几何结构提供）"

msgid "ozmat: Zmatrix coordinates (internally generated)"
msgstr "ozmat: Z矩阵坐标（内部生成）"

msgid ""
"pzmat: projected Zmatrix coordinates (Zmatrix needs to be provided via the "
"Input geometry)"
msgstr "pzmat: 投影Z矩阵坐标（需要通过输入几何结构提供Z矩阵）"

msgid ""
"opzmat: projected Zmatrix coordinates (Zmatrix is internally generated)"
msgstr "opzmat: 投影Z矩阵坐标（Z矩阵在内部生成）"

msgid ""
"nzmat: NOMODECO Zmatrix coordinates (Zmatrix needs to be provided via the "
"Input geometry)"
msgstr "nzmat: NOMODECO Z矩阵坐标（需要通过输入几何结构提供Z矩阵）"

msgid "onzmat: NOMODECO Zmatrix coordinates (Zmatrix is internally generated)"
msgstr "onzmat: NOMODECO Z矩阵坐标（Z矩阵在内部生成）"

msgid "deloc: Delocalised internal coordinates"
msgstr "deloc: 离域内坐标"

msgid "natint: Natural internal coordinates"
msgstr "natint: 自然内坐标"

msgid "pnatint: projected Natural internal coordinates"
msgstr "pnatint: 投影自然内坐标"

msgid "poly: polyspherical internal coordiantes"
msgstr "poly: 多球面内坐标"

msgid "Recommendations"
msgstr "建议"

msgid "It is recommended to"
msgstr "建议"

msgid ""
"use the ``ORIENT,MASS`` keyword in order to rotate the molecule into "
"standard orientation. This is necessary for a full exploitation of symmetry "
"within the generation of the potential energy surface."
msgstr "使用 ``ORIENT,MASS`` 关键字将分子旋转至标准取向。这对于在生成势能面时充分利用对称性是必要的。"

msgid "use the ``MASS,ISO`` keyword to use the most available isotopes."
msgstr "使用 ``MASS,ISO`` 关键字以使用最常用的同位素。"

msgid ""
"use multi-level schemes in combination with symmetry and run Molpro in "
"parallel in order to speed up the calculations. Explicitly correlated "
"methods are preferable over conventional approaches."
msgstr "使用结合对称性的多级方案并并行运行 Molpro 以加速计算。显式相关方法优于传统方法。"

msgid "always dump the potential energy surface to an external file."
msgstr "始终将势能面转储到外部文件。"

msgid "THE OLD PES GENERATOR (SURF)"
msgstr "旧的 PES 生成器 (SURF)"

msgid "``{XSURF,options}``"
msgstr "``{XSURF,options}``"

msgid ""
"G. Rauhut, *Efficient Calculation of Potential Energy Surfaces for the "
"Generation of Vibrational Wave Functions*, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.1804174>`__ **121**, 9313 (2004). B. Ziegler, "
"G. Rauhut, *Rigorous use of symmetry within the construction of "
"multidimensional potential energy surfaces*, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.5047912>`__ **149**, 164110 (2018). B. "
"Ziegler, G. Rauhut, *Localized Normal Coordinates in Accurate Vibrational "
"Structure Calculations: Benchmarks for Small Molecules*, `J. Chem. Theory "
"Comput. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acs.jctc.9b00381>`__ **15**, 4187 (2019)"
msgstr ""
"G. Rauhut, *Efficient Calculation of Potential Energy Surfaces for the "
"Generation of Vibrational Wave Functions*, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.1804174>`__ **121**, 9313 (2004). B. Ziegler, "
"G. Rauhut, *Rigorous use of symmetry within the construction of "
"multidimensional potential energy surfaces*, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.5047912>`__ **149**, 164110 (2018). B. "
"Ziegler, G. Rauhut, *Localized Normal Coordinates in Accurate Vibrational "
"Structure Calculations: Benchmarks for Small Molecules*, `J. Chem. Theory "
"Comput. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acs.jctc.9b00381>`__ **15**, 4187 (2019)"

msgid ""
"**``CORRECT``\\ =\\ *n*** (=1 (on) Default) If a certain subsurface does not"
" converge despite increasing the number of ab initio calculations, symmetry "
"in this subsurface (if any) will be neglected in order to avoid any errors "
"due to inaccuracies in the displacement vectors and the subsurface will be "
"recalculated accordingly. This option is automatically switched off in any "
"Taylor expansions of the PES."
msgstr ""
"**``CORRECT``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** (=1（开启）默认值) "
"如果某个子面在增加从头算计算次数后仍不收敛，则忽略该子面中的对称性（若有），以避免因位移矢量的不准确性而导致的误差，并相应地重新计算该子面。此选项在任何"
" PES 的 Taylor 展开中均自动关闭。"

msgid ""
"**``DELAUTO``\\ =\\ *variable***\\ (=\\ *off* Default) If ``DELAUTO``\\ =\\ "
"*on*, all not converged surfaces of the highest considered dimension are "
"deleted. It only works after a restart from an external file."
msgstr ""
"**``DELAUTO``\\ =\\ *\\ variable***\\ (=*\\ off\\ * 默认值) 若 ``DELAUTO``\\ =\\"
" *\\ on*，则删除所考虑的最高维度的所有未收敛面。仅在从外部文件重启后有效。"

msgid ""
"**``INFO``\\ =\\ *n*** (=1 Default) ``INFO``\\ =0 suppresses any information"
" about the program parameters and symmetry information. ``INFO``\\ =1 refers"
" to the standard output, while ``INFO``\\ =2 provides additional information"
" about the symmetry recognition."
msgstr ""
"**``INFO``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** (=1 默认值) ``INFO``\\ =0 抑制所有关于程序参数和对称性信息。\\ "
"``INFO``\\ =1 输出标准信息，而 ``INFO``\\ =2 额外提供关于对称性识别的信息。"

msgid ""
"**``LOWERDIM``\\ =\\ *n*** (=2 Default) In order to determine energy "
"differences for the subsurfaces, contributions of subsurfaces of lower order"
" need to be subtracted from those of current order. The lower order energy "
"contribution can be determined in three different ways: ``LOWERDIM``\\ =1 "
"uses Kronecker product fitting of the lower order terms and ``LOWERDIM``\\ "
"=2 retrieves this information from the intermediate fine grid representation"
" of the underlying subsurfaces."
msgstr ""
"**``LOWERDIM``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** (=2 默认值) "
"为了确定各子面的能量差，需要从当前阶的贡献中减去低阶子面的贡献。低阶能量贡献可以通过三种不同方式确定：\\ ``LOWERDIM``\\ =1 "
"使用低阶项的 Kronecker 积拟合，而 ``LOWERDIM``\\ =2 从底层子面的中间细网格表示中获取此信息。"

msgid ""
"**``MAXxD``\\ =\\ *n*** The maximum number of coarse grid points can be "
"controlled by the keywords ``MAX1D, MAX2D, MAX3D, MAX4D``. These 4 keywords "
"determine the maximum number of *ab initio* calculations in one dimension "
"for each 1D, 2D, 3D and 4D surface. The defaults are currently ``MAX1D=14``,"
" ``MAX2D=14``, ``MAX3D=12``, ``MAX4D=10``. Presently, values larger than 24 "
"are not supported."
msgstr ""
"**``MAXxD``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 粗网格点的最大数量可通过关键字 ``MAX1D, MAX2D, MAX3D, MAX4D`` "
"控制。这 4 个关键字分别确定每个 1D、2D、3D 和 4D 面在一个维度上的最大*\\ 从头算*计算次数。当前默认值为 ``MAX1D=14``\\"
" 、\\ ``MAX2D=14``\\ 、\\ ``MAX3D=12``\\ 、\\ ``MAX4D=10``\\ 。目前不支持大于 24 的值。"

msgid ""
"**``MINxD``\\ =\\ *n*** The minimum number of coarse grid points can be "
"controlled by the keywords ``MIN1D, MIN2D, MIN3D, MIN4D``. These 4 keywords "
"determine the minimum number of *ab initio* calculations in one dimension "
"for each 1D, 2D, 3D and 4D surface. The defaults are currently ``MIN1D=4, "
"MIN2D=4, MIN3D=4, MIN4D=4``. Presently, values larger than 24 are not "
"supported."
msgstr ""
"**``MINxD``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 粗网格点的最小数量可通过关键字 ``MIN1D, MIN2D, MIN3D, MIN4D`` "
"控制。这 4 个关键字分别确定每个 1D、2D、3D 和 4D 面在一个维度上的最小*\\ 从头算*计算次数。当前默认值为 ``MIN1D=4, "
"MIN2D=4, MIN3D=4, MIN4D=4``\\ 。目前不支持大于 24 的值。"

msgid ""
"**``MINxD_CRIT1``\\ =\\ *n*** Minimum number of ab initio calculations per "
"dimension, which are needed before a subsurfaces can be declared to be "
"converged according to criterion 1. For dimension 1-3 the default is 6, "
"while it is reduced to 4 for all higher order subsurfaces."
msgstr ""
"**``MINxD_CRIT1``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 每个维度所需的最小从头算计算次数，只有在达到此数目后，子面才能根据判据 1 "
"被宣布为收敛。对于 1-3 维，默认值为 6，而对于所有更高阶子面则降为 4。"

msgid ""
"**``MPG``\\ =\\ *n*** Symmetry of the normal modes is recognized by the "
"program automatically. Symmetry of the modes will be determined even if the "
"``NOSYM`` keyword is used in the electronic structure calculations. In "
"certain cases numerical noise can be very high and thus prohibits a correct "
"determination of the symmetry labels. Symmetry can be switched off by using "
"``MPG=1``."
msgstr ""
"**``MPG``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 程序会自动识别简正模式的对称性。即使在电子结构计算中使用了 ``NOSYM`` "
"关键字，也会确定模式的对称性。在某些情况下，数值噪声可能非常大，从而妨碍正确确定对称性标签。可以通过使用 ``MPG=1`` 关闭对称性。"

msgid ""
"**``NDIM``\\ =\\ *n*** The keyword ``NDIM=n`` terminates the expansion of "
"the PES after the :math:`n`-body term. The default is set to 3. Please note,"
" when you use ``NDIM=4`` as a keyword for the ``XSURF`` program, you need to"
" pass this information to the ``VSCF`` and ``VCI`` programs also. Otherwise "
"these programs will neglect the 4-body terms."
msgstr ""
"**``NDIM``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 关键字 ``NDIM=n`` 在 :math:`n` 体项之后终止 PES 的展开。默认值设为 "
"3。请注意，当您在 ``XSURF`` 程序中使用 ``NDIM=4`` 作为关键字时，也需要将此信息传递给 ``VSCF`` 和 ``VCI`` "
"程序。否则，这些程序将忽略 4 体项。"

msgid ""
"**``NGRID``\\ =\\ *n*** Based on a coarse grid of *ab initio* points a fine "
"grid will be generated from automated interpolation techniques. The keyword "
"``NGRID=n`` determines the number of equidistant grid points in one "
"dimension. ``NGRID=n`` has to be an even number. The default is currently "
"set to 16."
msgstr ""
"**``NGRID``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 基于*\\ 从头算*点的粗网格，将通过自动插值技术生成细网格。关键字 ``NGRID=n`` "
"确定一个维度上的等距网格点数目。\\ ``NGRID=n`` 必须为偶数。当前默认值设为 16。"

msgid ""
"**``NSA``\\ =\\ *n*** (=1 Default) This option prints out some information "
"about the progress of the ``XSURF`` calculation. ``NSA``\\ =1 prints this "
"information is an additional file, which will be deleted once the ``XSURF`` "
"calculation is completed, ``NSA``\\ =2 prints this information to the "
"console."
msgstr ""
"**``NSA``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** (=1 默认值) 此选项打印一些关于 ``XSURF`` 计算进度的信息。\\ ``NSA``\\ "
"=1 将此信息打印到附加文件中，该文件在 ``XSURF`` 计算完成后将被删除；\\ ``NSA``\\ =2 将此信息打印到控制台。"

msgid ""
"**``ONLYHEAD``\\ =\\ *n*** (=0 (off) Default) If set to 1, the ``XSURF`` "
"calculation will be terminated after writing the header of the external "
"restart file, i.e. prior to the calculation of the 1D terms. The call of any"
" other programs beyond ``XSURF`` will be ignored."
msgstr ""
"**``ONLYHEAD``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** (=0（关闭）默认值) 若设为 1，\\ ``XSURF`` "
"计算将在写入外部重启文件头之后终止，即在计算 1D 项之前。对 ``XSURF`` 之外的任何其他程序的调用将被忽略。"

msgid ""
"``ORIENT`` Allows to specify a certain orientation of the molecule. With "
"``ORIENT=//yes//`` (Default) the orientation is chosen automatically "
"according to the asymmetric parameter of the molecule. To choose a certain "
"orientation, ``ORIENT=//XC//`` need to be set. X represents a number from 1 "
"to 3 (in arabic or roman letters), and C need to be set to **r** or **l**. "
"For example, ``ORIENT=//IIl//`` orientates the molecule according to the "
"**IIl** convention. ``ORIENT=//old//`` does not rotate the molecule at all."
msgstr ""
"``ORIENT`` 允许指定分子的特定取向。使用 ``ORIENT=//yes//``\\ "
"（默认值）时，取向根据分子的非对称参数自动选择。要选择特定取向，需设置 ``ORIENT=//XC//``\\ 。X 表示 1 到 3 "
"的数字（阿拉伯数字或罗马数字），C 需设为 **r** 或 **l**\\ 。例如，\\ ``ORIENT=//IIl//`` 按照 **IIl** "
"约定为分子定向。\\ ``ORIENT=//old//`` 完全不旋转分子。"

msgid ""
"**``RDM``\\ =\\ *n*** (=0 (off) Default) Degenerate modes can be rotated in "
"a manner, that the corresponding 1D potentials will be identical. By "
"default, this feature is switched off, but can be activated by ``RDM``\\ =1."
" Typically this results in rotational angles of 45 or 135 degrees."
msgstr ""
"**``RDM``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** (=0（关闭）默认值) 简并模式可以以某种方式旋转，使得相应的 1D "
"势能完全相同。默认情况下，此功能处于关闭状态，但可以通过 ``RDM``\\ =1 激活。通常这会导致旋转角为 45 或 135 度。"

msgid ""
"**``RDM_THR``\\ =\\ *n*** (=1.0d-10 Default) This threshold controls, if the"
" potentials of two degenerate modes are identical or not. See the keyword "
"``RDM``\\ =\\ *n*."
msgstr ""
"**``RDM_THR``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** (=1.0d-10 默认值) 此阈值控制两个简并模式的势能是否相同。参见关键字 "
"``RDM``\\ =\\ *\\ n*。"

msgid ""
"**``SKIP``\\ =\\ *n*** (=1 (on) Default) By default, (pre)screening of any "
"terms higher than 2D of the PES expansion is switched on. It can be "
"deactivated by ``SKIP``\\ =0."
msgstr ""
"**``SKIP``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** (=1（开启）默认值) 默认情况下，PES 展开中高于 2D 的任何项都会启用（预）筛选。可以通过 "
"``SKIP``\\ =0 将其停用。"

msgid ""
"**``SKIPCRIT``\\ =\\ *n*** (=1 Default) ``SKIPCRIT`` defines the method and "
"thus the criterion for (pre)screening of the high-order terms of the PES "
"expansion. ``SKIPCRIT``\\ =1 activates prescreening and ``SKIPCRIT``\\ =2 "
"screening. In the latter case a label must be defined (see ``SKIPLABEL``)."
msgstr ""
"**``SKIPCRIT``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** (=1 默认值) ``SKIPCRIT`` 定义了 PES "
"展开中高阶项（预）筛选的方法及判据。\\ ``SKIPCRIT``\\ =1 激活预筛选，\\ ``SKIPCRIT``\\ =2 "
"激活筛选。在后一种情况下，必须定义一个标签（参见 ``SKIPLABEL``\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"**``SKIPLAB``\\ =\\ *variable*** The name of the label in the input stream "
"must be defined, which determines the electronic structure level to be used "
"for screening the high-order terms of a PES expansion."
msgstr ""
"**``SKIPLAB``\\ =\\ *\\ variable*** 必须定义输入流中标签的名称，该标签决定用于筛选 PES "
"展开高阶项的电子结构级别。"

msgid ""
"**``SKIP_THRx(i)``\\ =\\ *value*** (:math:`x`\\ =1,2 :math:`i`\\ =1,2,...) "
"Definition of thresholds used for prescreening (``SKIP_THR1``) and screening"
" ``SKIP_THR2`` (see option ``SKIPCRIT``). :math:`i` specifies the individual"
" orders of the :math:`n`-mode expansion of the PES. The defaults are "
"``SKIP_THR1(1)``\\ =0.0d0, ``SKIP_THR1(2)``\\ =0.0d0, ``SKIP_THR1(3)``\\ "
"=1.0d-18, ``SKIP_THR1(4)``\\ =1.0d-27 and ``SKIP_THR2(1)``\\ =0.0d0, "
"``SKIP_THR2(2)``\\ =0.0d0, ``SKIP_THR2(3)``\\ =1.0d-2, ``SKIP_THR2(4)``\\ "
"=1.0d-1. All other thresholds are not yet defined and need to be entered "
"explicitly."
msgstr ""
"**``SKIP_THRx(i)``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** (:math:`x`\\ =1,2 :math:`i`\\ "
"=1,2,...) 定义用于预筛选（\\ ``SKIP_THR1``\\ ）和筛选 ``SKIP_THR2``\\ （参见选项 "
"``SKIPCRIT``\\ ）的阈值。\\ :math:`i` 指定 PES 的 :math:`n` 模展开的各个阶。默认值为 "
"``SKIP_THR1(1)``\\ =0.0d0、\\ ``SKIP_THR1(2)``\\ =0.0d0、\\ ``SKIP_THR1(3)``\\"
" =1.0d-18、\\ ``SKIP_THR1(4)``\\ =1.0d-27 以及 ``SKIP_THR2(1)``\\ =0.0d0、\\ "
"``SKIP_THR2(2)``\\ =0.0d0、\\ ``SKIP_THR2(3)``\\ =1.0d-2、\\ "
"``SKIP_THR2(4)``\\ =1.0d-1。所有其他阈值尚未定义，需要显式输入。"

msgid ""
"**``START1D``\\ =\\ *label*** (=LABEL1 default) Sets the label to start the "
"calculations for the 1D terms of the potential."
msgstr "**``START1D``\\ =\\ *\\ label*** (=LABEL1 默认值) 设置用于开始计算势能 1D 项的标签。"

msgid ""
"**``STOP``\\ =\\ *i*** (=1000 Default) The calculation of an :math:`n`-mode "
"expansion of a PES can be terminated at lower orders, specified by ``STOP``,"
" while all information for the high-order terms is already provided in the "
"header of the external restart file and the potential information once a "
"multi-level scheme has been used."
msgstr ""
"**``STOP``\\ =\\ *\\ i*** (=1000 默认值) PES 的 :math:`n` 模展开计算可以在较低阶处终止，由 "
"``STOP`` 指定，而高阶项的所有信息已在外部重启文件头中提供，且一旦使用了多级方案，势能信息也已提供。"

msgid ""
"**``SYM``\\ =\\ *variable*** Symmetry within electronic structure "
"calculations can be exploited by the keyword ``SYM=Auto`` (which is the "
"default). Usually this leads to significant time savings. The symmetry "
"recognition can be switched off by ``SYM=NOSYM`` as certain calculations may"
" cause some trouble (e.g. local correlation methods). Symmetry in electronic"
" structure calculations may not be mistaken by the symmetry of the mode-"
"coupling terms (see keyword ``MPG``). Once ``SYM=Auto`` is used, it is "
"advisable to insert an ``INT`` card prior to the call of the Hartree-Fock "
"program."
msgstr ""
"**``SYM``\\ =\\ *\\ variable*** 电子结构计算中的对称性可以通过关键字 ``SYM=Auto``\\ "
"（默认值）加以利用。通常这可以显著节省时间。可以通过 ``SYM=NOSYM`` "
"关闭对称性识别，因为某些计算可能引起问题（例如局域相关方法）。电子结构计算中的对称性不应与模式耦合项的对称性混淆（参见关键字 ``MPG``\\ "
"）。一旦使用 ``SYM=Auto``\\ ，建议在调用 Hartree-Fock 程序之前插入 ``INT`` 卡。"

msgid ""
"**``THRDEGx``\\ =\\ *value*** (:math:`x`\\ =1,2,...) Threshold used for "
"recognizing degeneracies within the individual orders of the PES expansion. "
"The defaults are ``THRDEG1``\\ =5.0d-5, ``THRDEG2``\\ =1.0d-5,\\ "
"``THRDEG3``\\ =5.0d-6,\\ ``THRDEG4``\\ =1.0d-6."
msgstr ""
"**``THRDEGx``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** (:math:`x`\\ =1,2,...) 用于识别 PES "
"展开各阶内简并性的阈值。默认值为 ``THRDEG1``\\ =5.0d-5、\\ ``THRDEG2``\\ =1.0d-5、\\ "
"``THRDEG3``\\ =5.0d-6、\\ ``THRDEG4``\\ =1.0d-6。"

msgid ""
"**``THRFITx``\\ =\\ *value*** (:math:`x`\\ =1,2,...) Threshold used for "
"testing on convergence of a subsurface according to criterion 1 for the "
"individual orders of the PES expansion. The defaults are ``THRFIT1``\\ "
"=2.0d-3, ``THRFIT2``\\ =5.0d-3,\\ ``THRFIT3``\\ =5.0d-3,\\ ``THRFIT4``\\ "
"=2.0d-2. Criterion 1 controls the convergence of the intermediate fine grid."
msgstr ""
"**``THRFITx``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** (:math:`x`\\ =1,2,...) 用于根据判据 1 检验 PES "
"展开各阶子面收敛性的阈值。默认值为 ``THRFIT1``\\ =2.0d-3、\\ ``THRFIT2``\\ =5.0d-3、\\ "
"``THRFIT3``\\ =5.0d-3、\\ ``THRFIT4``\\ =2.0d-2。判据 1 控制中间细网格的收敛性。"

msgid ""
"**``THRLOWx``\\ =\\ *value*** (:math:`x`\\ =1,2,...) Threshold used for "
"testing on convergence of a subsurface according to criterion 2 for the "
"individual orders of the PES expansion. The defaults are ``THRLOW1``\\ "
"=0.0d0, ``THRLOW2``\\ =5.0d-7,\\ ``THRLOW3``\\ =1.0d-6,\\ ``THRLOW4``\\ "
"=2.0d-6. Criterion 2 controls the convergence with respect to the ab initio "
"single points."
msgstr ""
"**``THRLOWx``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** (:math:`x`\\ =1,2,...) 用于根据判据 2 检验 PES "
"展开各阶子面收敛性的阈值。默认值为 ``THRLOW1``\\ =0.0d0、\\ ``THRLOW2``\\ =5.0d-7、\\ "
"``THRLOW3``\\ =1.0d-6、\\ ``THRLOW4``\\ =2.0d-6。判据 2 控制相对于从头算单点的收敛性。"

msgid ""
"**``THRSED``\\ =\\ *value*** (=1.0d-6 Default) Threshold for determining "
"symmetry elements of the molecule."
msgstr "**``THRSED``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** (=1.0d-6 默认值) 用于确定分子对称元素的阈值。"

msgid ""
"**``THRSYMx``\\ =\\ *value*** (:math:`x`\\ =1,2,...) Threshold used for "
"recognizing symmetry within a subsurface of the PES expansion - in "
"dependence on the order of the expansion term. The defaults are "
"``THRSYM1``\\ =5.0d-5, ``THRSYM2``\\ =1.0d-5,\\ ``THRSYM3``\\ =5.0d-6,\\ "
"``THRSYM4``\\ =5.0d-6,\\ ``THRSYM5``\\ =1.0d-7."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"**``USEMRCC``\\ =\\ *n*** Once the MRCC program of M. Kallay or the Gecco "
"program of A. Köhn is used for determining individual grid points, the "
"option ``USEMRCC=1`` needs to be set, which is needed to ensure proper "
"communication between Molpro and Mrcc. Default: ``USEMRCC=0``."
msgstr ""
"**``USEMRCC``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 一旦使用 M. Kallay 的 MRCC 程序或 A. Köhn 的 Gecco "
"程序来确定各个网格点，就需要设置选项 ``USEMRCC=1``\\ ，以确保 Molpro 与 Mrcc 之间的正确通信。默认值：\\ "
"``USEMRCC=0``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"**``VAR1D``\\ =\\ *variable*** The ``XSURF`` program reads the energy of "
"electronic structure calculations from the internal Molpro variables, e.g. "
"``ENERGY``, ``EMP2``, :math:`\\dots`. The internal variable is specified by "
"the keyword ``VAR1D``. The default for the ``VAR1D`` keyword is the internal"
" variable ``ENERGY``."
msgstr ""
"**``VAR1D``\\ =\\ *\\ variable*** ``XSURF`` 程序从 Molpro 内部变量（例如 ``ENERGY``\\ "
"、\\ ``EMP2``\\ 、\\ :math:`\\dots`\\ ）读取电子结构计算的能量。内部变量由关键字 ``VAR1D`` 指定。\\ "
"``VAR1D`` 关键字的默认值为内部变量 ``ENERGY``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"**``VIBIRREP``\\ =\\ *variable*** The irreps of the vibrations within the "
"XSURF, VSCF and VCI programs may differ from those within the FREQ program "
"as the molecules will be be reoriented according to the conventions (see "
"keyword ``ORIENT``). In order to use the same irreps as in the FREQ program,"
" one may use ``VIBIRREP=Sort``."
msgstr ""
"**``VIBIRREP``\\ =\\ *\\ variable*** XSURF、VSCF 和 VCI 程序中振动的不可约表示可能不同于 FREQ "
"程序中的不可约表示，因为分子会根据约定重新定向（参见关键字 ``ORIENT``\\ ）。为了使用与 FREQ 程序中相同的不可约表示，可以使用 "
"``VIBIRREP=Sort``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"<!--  \\* **``GMAT``\\ =\\ *n*** If the vibrational frequencies sould be "
"computed with the Gmatrix formalism, :math:`n` determines the dimension of "
"the expansion of the Wilson Gmatrix. Higher than 2 is not recommended"
msgstr ""
"<!--  \\* **``GMAT``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 如果振动频率应使用 G 矩阵形式计算，则 :math:`n` 确定 Wilson"
" G 矩阵展开的维度。不建议大于 2"

msgid ""
"**``PSEUDOPOT``\\ =\\ *n***. If the vibrational frequencies sould be "
"computed with the Gmatrix formalism, :math:`n` determines the dimension of "
"the expansion of the Wilson pseudopotential. Higher than 2 is not "
"recommended-->"
msgstr ""
"**``PSEUDOPOT``\\ =\\ *\\ n***。如果振动频率应使用 G 矩阵形式计算，则 :math:`n` 确定 Wilson "
"赝势展开的维度。不建议大于 2-->"

msgid ""
"The following example shows the input of a calculation which computes energy"
" and dipole surfaces at the MP2/cc-pVTZ level and subsequently determines "
"the anharmonic frequencies at the VSCF and VCI levels. Hartree-Fock "
"calculations will not be restarted and the runtime option --logfile-scratch "
"directs the .log-files to the scratch directory as defined by the $TMPDIR "
"variable."
msgstr ""
"以下示例展示了一个计算的输入，该计算在 MP2/cc-pVTZ 理论水平下计算能量曲面和偶极矩曲面，随后在 VSCF 和 VCI "
"理论水平下确定非谐频率。Hartree-Fock 计算将不会重启，运行时选项 --logfile-scratch 将 .log 文件定向到由 "
"$TMPDIR 变量定义的临时目录。"

msgid "``INTENSITY,options``"
msgstr "``INTENSITY,options``"

msgid ""
"**``DIPOLE``\\ =\\ *n*** Allows to switch between the different dipole "
"surface calculations. ``DIPOLE=0`` switches off all dipole calculations. "
"``DIPOLE=1`` (this is the default) computes the dipole surfaces at the "
"Hartree Fock level of theory, and therefore does not increase the "
"computation time of the electronic structure calculations. ``DIPOLE=2`` "
"switches on the dipole surfaces at the full level of theory, therefore "
"``CPHF,1`` is required. This effectively doubles the computation time for "
"surface calculations."
msgstr ""
"**``DIPOLE``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 允许在不同的偶极矩曲面计算之间切换。\\ ``DIPOLE=0`` 关闭所有偶极矩计算。\\ "
"``DIPOLE=1``\\ （这是默认值）在 Hartree-Fock 理论水平下计算偶极矩曲面，因此不会增加电子结构计算的计算时间。\\ "
"``DIPOLE=2`` 开启完整理论水平下的偶极矩曲面，因此需要 ``CPHF,1``\\ 。这实际上使曲面计算的计算时间翻倍。"

msgid ""
"**``NDIMDIP``\\ =\\ *n*** This denotes the term after which the "
":math:`n`-body expansion of the dipole surfaces is truncated. The default is"
" set to 3. Note that ``NDIMDIP`` has to be lower or equal to ``NDIM``."
msgstr ""
"**``NDIMDIP``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 这表示偶极矩曲面的 :math:`n` 体展开被截断的项。默认值设为 3。注意 "
"``NDIMDIP`` 必须小于或等于 ``NDIM``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"**``NDIMPOL``\\ =\\ *n*** This variable denotes the term after which the "
":math:`n`-body expansion of the polarizability tensor surfaces is truncated."
" The default is set to 0. Note that ``NDIMPOL`` has to be lower or equal to "
"``NDIM`` and must be smaller than 4. Note that currently only Hartree-Fock "
"and MP2 polarizabilities are supported, which requires the ``POLARI`` "
"keyword in the respective programs. Besides that, the frozen core "
"approximation cannot yet be employed within the calculation of MP2 "
"polarizabilities."
msgstr ""
"**``NDIMPOL``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 此变量表示极化率张量曲面的 :math:`n` 体展开被截断的项。默认值设为 0。注意 "
"``NDIMPOL`` 必须小于或等于 ``NDIM`` 且必须小于 4。注意目前仅支持 Hartree-Fock 和 MP2 "
"极化率，这需要在相应程序中使用 ``POLARI`` 关键字。此外，在 MP2 极化率的计算中尚不能采用冻芯近似。"

msgid ""
"**``NDIMQUAD``\\ =\\ *n*** This variable denotes the term after which the "
":math:`n`-body expansion of the quadrupole tensor surfaces is truncated. The"
" default is set to 0. Note that ``NDIMQUAD`` has to be lower or equal to "
"``NDIM`` and must be smaller than 4."
msgstr ""
"**``NDIMQUAD``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 此变量表示四极矩张量曲面的 :math:`n` 体展开被截断的项。默认值设为 0。注意 "
"``NDIMQUAD`` 必须小于或等于 ``NDIM`` 且必须小于 4。"

msgid ""
"**``POLYSYM``\\ =\\ *variable*** (=ON Default). Symmetry in the "
"polarizability surfaces differs from symmetry in energy or dipole surfaces "
"and its recognition can be switched on or off. Symmetry is only detected "
"based on geometrical parameters."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"**``QUADYSYM``\\ =\\ *variable*** (=ON Default). Symmetry in the quadrupole "
"surfaces differs from symmetry in energy or dipole surfaces and its "
"recognition can be switched on or off. Symmetry is only detected based on "
"geometrical parameters."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"**``VARDIPxDX``\\ =\\ *variable*** (x=1..4) Variable which is used for the "
":math:`x` direction of the dipole moment for 1D surfaces."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"**``VARDIPxDY``\\ =\\ *variable*** (x=1..4) Variable which is used for the "
":math:`y` direction of the dipole moment for 1D surfaces."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"**``VARDIPxDZ``\\ =\\ *variable*** (x=1..4) Variable which is used for the "
":math:`z` direction of the dipole moment for 1D surfaces."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"**``VARPOLxDXX``\\ =\\ *variable*** (x=1..4) Variable which is used for the "
":math:`xx` component of the polarizability tensor for 1D surfaces."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"**``VARPOLxDYY``\\ =\\ *variable*** (x=1..4) Variable which is used for the "
":math:`yy` component of the polarizability tensor for 1D surfaces."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"**``VARPOLxDZZ``\\ =\\ *variable*** (x=1..4) Variable which is used for the "
":math:`zz` component of the polarizability tensor for 1D surfaces."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"**``VARPOLxDXY``\\ =\\ *variable*** (x=1..4) Variable which is used for the "
":math:`xy` component of the polarizability tensor for 1D surfaces."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"**``VARPOLxDXZ``\\ =\\ *variable*** (x=1..4) Variable which is used for the "
":math:`xz` component of the polarizability tensor for 1D surfaces."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"**``VARPOLxDYZ``\\ =\\ *variable*** (x=1..4) Variable which is used for the "
":math:`yz` component of the polarizability tensor for 1D surfaces."
msgstr ""

msgid "``DISK,options``"
msgstr "``DISK,options``"

msgid ""
"**``AUTO``\\ =\\ *n*** For Franck-Condon calculations this allows to specify"
" the number of the two potential energy surfaces."
msgstr "**``AUTO``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 对于 Franck-Condon 计算，这允许指定两个势能面的编号。"

msgid ""
"**``DUMP``\\ =\\ *file name*** The potential can be dumped into an external "
"ASCII-file which can be used for restarting. Its name must be provided as "
"the argument of the ``DUMP`` keyword, e.g. ``DUMP=’formaldehyde.pot’``. The "
"ASCII-file provides the interface to other programs and offers the "
"possibility for controlled storage and modification of the computed "
"potentials. Dipole and polarizability surfaces will also be dumped if "
"available."
msgstr ""
"**``DUMP``\\ =\\ *\\ file name*** 势能可以转储到外部 ASCII 文件中，该文件可用于重启。其名称必须作为 "
"``DUMP`` 关键字的参数提供，例如 ``DUMP=’formaldehyde.pot’``\\ 。ASCII "
"文件提供了与其他程序的接口，并提供了对计算所得势能进行受控存储和修改的可能性。偶极矩和极化率曲面（如果可用）也将被转储。"

msgid ""
"**``EXTERN``\\ =\\ *file name*** ``XSURF`` calculations are restartable at "
"any point of a truncated calculation as long as the automatically generated "
"file \\*.pot_RESTART is available."
msgstr ""
"**``EXTERN``\\ =\\ *\\ file name*** 只要自动生成的文件 \\*.pot_RESTART 可用，\\ "
"``XSURF`` 计算就可以在截断计算的任何点重启。"

msgid ""
"**``SAVE``\\ =\\ *record*** Once a complete surface has been generated, a "
"record can be specified, where to dump the potential in the temporary binary"
" files. Once this keyword is not provided explicitly, the potential will be "
"dumped in record 5600.2"
msgstr ""
"**``SAVE``\\ =\\ *\\ record*** "
"一旦生成了完整的曲面，就可以指定一个记录，以将势能转储到临时二进制文件中。如果未明确提供此关键字，则势能将转储到记录 5600.2 中"

msgid ""
"**``TIME``\\ =\\ *value*** (=3600.00 Default) Time given in seconds for the "
"next dumping of the restart file. For long lasting electronic structure "
"single point calculations it is useful to increase this value."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"**``WHERE``\\ =\\ *variable*** In combination with the keywords ``DUMP`` and"
" ``EXTERN`` for an external restart file, the keyword ``WHERE`` specifies "
"the path for the external ASCII file. Two options are available, "
"``WHERE=home`` and ``WHERE=scr``. As the external files can be huge for "
"``XSURF`` calculations, they will be stored on the scratch disk given by the"
" Molpro variable ``$TMPDIR`` by default."
msgstr ""
"**``WHERE``\\ =\\ *\\ variable*** 与关键字 ``DUMP`` 和 ``EXTERN``\\ "
"（用于外部重启文件）结合使用时，关键字 ``WHERE`` 指定外部 ASCII 文件的路径。有两个选项可用：\\ ``WHERE=home`` 和 "
"``WHERE=scr``\\ 。由于 ``XSURF`` 计算的外部文件可能很大，默认情况下它们将存储在由 Molpro 变量 ``$TMPDIR``"
" 指定的临时磁盘上。"

msgid "``VTAYLOR,options``"
msgstr "``VTAYLOR,options``"

msgid ""
"**``ORDER``\\ =\\ *n*** (=5 Default) Number of basis functions within the "
"Taylor expansion."
msgstr "**``ORDER``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** (=5 默认值) Taylor 展开中基函数的数目。"

msgid ""
"**``POINTS``\\ =\\ *n*** (=5 Default) Number of ab initio points controlling"
" the accuracy of the derivatives (e.g. 5-point formula)."
msgstr "**``POINTS``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** (=5 默认值) 控制导数精度的从头算点数目（例如 5 点公式）。"

msgid ""
"**``SCALE``\\ =\\ *value*** (=1.0d-1 Default) This keyword controls the step"
" width."
msgstr "**``SCALE``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** (=1.0d-1 默认值) 该关键字控制步长。"

msgid "**``TYPE``\\ =\\ *variable***"
msgstr "**``TYPE``\\ =\\ *\\ variable***"

msgid "``VMULT,options``"
msgstr "``VMULT,options``"

msgid ""
"**``MULTI``\\ =\\ *n*** The keywords ``START1D``, ``START2D``, ``START3D`` "
"in combination with the commands ``VAR1D``, ``VAR2D`` and ``VAR3D`` allow "
"for the calculation of multi-level potential energy surfaces. This would "
"imply in principle that the 1D term of the potential needs to be computed at"
" all three levels and the 2D term at two computational levels. As certain "
"low level results are byproducts of more sophisticated methods (e.g. the HF "
"energy is a byproduct of an MP2 calculation or the MP2 energy is a byproduct"
" of a CCSD(T) calculation) the computational overhead can be avoided by the "
"``MULTI`` option."
msgstr ""
"**``MULTI``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 关键字 ``START1D``\\ 、\\ ``START2D``\\ 、\\ "
"``START3D`` 与命令 ``VAR1D``\\ 、\\ ``VAR2D`` 和 ``VAR3D`` "
"结合使用，可以计算多级势能面。原则上这意味着势能的 1D 项需要在所有三个级别上计算，而 2D "
"项需要在两个计算级别上计算。由于某些低级别结果是由更精细的方法顺带产生的（例如 HF 能量是 MP2 计算顺带产生的，MP2 能量是 CCSD(T) "
"计算顺带产生的），因此可以通过 ``MULTI`` 选项避免额外的计算开销。"

msgid ""
"``MULTI=1:`` This is the default and most expensive choice. The 1D potential"
" will be computed at all 3 levels of theory. Likewise, the 2D potential will"
" be calculated at 2 levels explicitly. An example would be: <code>"
msgstr ""
"``MULTI=1:`` 这是默认值，也是最昂贵的选择。1D 势将在所有 3 个理论级别上计算。同样，2D 势将显式地在 2 "
"个级别上计算。示例如下：<code>"

msgid "1D: CCSD(T)/cc-pVTZ 2D: MP4(SDQ)/cc-pVTZ 3D: MP2/cc-pVDZ"
msgstr "1D: CCSD(T)/cc-pVTZ 2D: MP4(SDQ)/cc-pVTZ 3D: MP2/cc-pVDZ"

msgid "{XSURF,Sym=auto"
msgstr "{XSURF,Sym=auto"

msgid "1D: CCSD(T)/cc-pVTZ 2D: CCSD(T)/cc-pVTZ 3D: MP2/cc-pVTZ"
msgstr "1D: CCSD(T)/cc-pVTZ 2D: CCSD(T)/cc-pVTZ 3D: MP2/cc-pVTZ"

msgid "</code><code> 1D: CCSD(T)/cc-pVTZ 2D: MP2/cc-pVTZ 3D: MP2/cc-pVTZ"
msgstr "</code><code> 1D: CCSD(T)/cc-pVTZ 2D: MP2/cc-pVTZ 3D: MP2/cc-pVTZ"

msgid "1D: CCSD(T)/cc-pVTZ 2D: MP4(SDQ)/cc-pVTZ 3D: MP2/cc-pVTZ"
msgstr "1D: CCSD(T)/cc-pVTZ 2D: MP4(SDQ)/cc-pVTZ 3D: MP2/cc-pVTZ"

msgid ""
"</code> <code> 1D: CCSD(T)/cc-pVTZ 2D: MP4(SDQ)/cc-pVTZ 3D: MP4(SDQ)/cc-pVTZ"
msgstr ""
"</code> <code> 1D: CCSD(T)/cc-pVTZ 2D: MP4(SDQ)/cc-pVTZ 3D: MP4(SDQ)/cc-pVTZ"

msgid "1D: CCSD(T)/cc-pVTZ 2D: CCSD(T)/cc-pVTZ 3D: MP4(SDQ)/cc-pVTZ"
msgstr "1D: CCSD(T)/cc-pVTZ 2D: CCSD(T)/cc-pVTZ 3D: MP4(SDQ)/cc-pVTZ"

msgid "</code> <code> 1D: CCSD(T)/cc-pVTZ 2D: MP2/cc-pVTZ 3D: MP2/cc-pVDZ"
msgstr "</code> <code> 1D: CCSD(T)/cc-pVTZ 2D: MP2/cc-pVTZ 3D: MP2/cc-pVDZ"

msgid ""
"**``STARTxD``\\ =\\ *label*** (x=2..4) Definition of the label in the input "
"stream specifying the 2nd, 3rd and 4th electronic structure method of the "
"multi-level scheme."
msgstr ""
"**``STARTxD``\\ =\\ *\\ label*** (x=2..4) 在输入流中定义标签，用于指定多级方案的第 2、第 3 和第 4 "
"电子结构方法。"

msgid ""
"**``VARxD``\\ =\\ *variable*** Molpro variable to be read for the higher "
"levels of the multi-level scheme."
msgstr "**``VARxD``\\ =\\ *\\ variable*** 为多级方案的更高级别读取的 Molpro 变量。"

msgid "\\* ``MULTI=1``:"
msgstr "\\* ``MULTI=1``\\ ："

msgid "\\* ``MULTI=2``:"
msgstr "\\* ``MULTI=2``\\ ："

msgid "\\* ``MULTI=3``:"
msgstr "\\* ``MULTI=3``\\ ："

msgid "\\* ``MULTI=4``:"
msgstr "\\* ``MULTI=4``\\ ："

msgid "``LINCOMB,options``"
msgstr "``LINCOMB,options``"

msgid ""
"**``ANGLE``\\ =\\ *value*** Rotation angle in degree. This keyword requires "
"the specification of two normal coordinates provided by ``NM1`` and ``NM2``."
msgstr ""
"**``ANGLE``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 旋转角度（以度为单位）。该关键字需要通过 ``NM1`` 和 ``NM2`` "
"指定两个简正坐标。"

msgid ""
"**``BLx``\\ =\\ *n*** This option assigns mode :math:`n` to block :math:`x`."
" For example, the line ``LINCOMB,BL1=1,BL1=2,BL2=5,BL2=6`` for a 4-atomic "
"molecule assigns modes 1 and 2 to a 1st block and thus these two modes will "
"be localized afterwards. Modes 3 and 4 will not be affected and thus refer "
"to standard normal coordinates, while modes 5 and 6 constitute a 2nd block"
msgstr ""
"**``BLx``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 该选项将模式 :math:`n` 分配给块 :math:`x`\\ 。例如，对于四原子分子，行 "
"``LINCOMB,BL1=1,BL1=2,BL2=5,BL2=6`` 将模式 1 和 2 分配给第 1 个块，因此这两个模式随后将被定域化。模式 3 "
"和 4 不受影响，因此仍指标准简正坐标，而模式 5 和 6 构成第 2 个块"

msgid ""
"**``LOCAL``\\ =\\ *n*** ``LOCAL``\\ =1 localizes the normal coordinates of "
"the CH-stretchings. Note that this destroys symmetry of these modes. Usually"
" localization has strong impact on subsequent ``VSCF`` calculations. "
"``LOCAL``\\ =2 localizes the normal coordinates of a molecular cluster to "
"the contributing entities. This localization scheme localizes within the "
"individual irreps, which usually leads to a very faint localization. "
"Switching symmetry off by ``MPG``\\ =1 in the ``XSURF`` program leads to a "
"much stronger localization."
msgstr ""
"**``LOCAL``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** ``LOCAL``\\ =1 对 CH "
"伸缩的简正坐标进行定域化。注意这会破坏这些模式的对称性。通常定域化会对后续的 ``VSCF`` 计算产生强烈影响。\\ ``LOCAL``\\ =2 "
"将分子簇的简正坐标定域化到各组成实体上。该定域化方案在各个不可约表示内进行定域化，这通常导致非常微弱的定域化。在 ``XSURF`` 程序中通过 "
"``MPG``\\ =1 关闭对称性会导致强得多的定域化。"

msgid ""
"**``NM1``\\ =\\ *n*, ``NM2``\\ =\\ *m*** Denotes the normal coordinates to "
"be rotated."
msgstr "**``NM1``\\ =\\ *\\ n\\ *, ``NM2``\\ =\\ *\\ m*** 表示要旋转的简正坐标。"

msgid ""
"**``THRLOC``\\ =\\ *value*** (=1.0d-6 Default) Threshold within the "
"localization procedure."
msgstr "**``THRLOC``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** (=1.0d-6 默认值) 定域化过程中的阈值。"

msgid "``SCALNM,options``"
msgstr "``SCALNM,options``"

msgid ""
"**``AUTO``\\ =//on / off//** ``AUTO``\\ =\\ *on* (default) switches on an "
"automatic scaling procedure of the potential in order to determine "
"meaningful elongations and ``SHIFT`` values with respect to all coordinates,"
" i.e. for each normal mode an optimized scaling parameter ``SFAC`` and "
"``SHIFT`` parameter will be determined. Usually this results in an increased"
" number of 1D grid points. The ``AUTO`` keyword intrinsically depends on the"
" thresholds and parameters, which can be controlled by the keywords "
"``THRSHIFT``, ``ITMAX``, ``LEVMAX``, ``DENSMAX``, and ``DENSMIN``."
msgstr ""
"**``AUTO``\\ =//on / off//** ``AUTO``\\ =\\ *on*\\ "
"（默认值）开启势能的自动缩放过程，以便相对于所有坐标确定有意义的伸长量和 ``SHIFT`` 值，即为每个简正模式确定优化的缩放参数 ``SFAC`` "
"和 ``SHIFT`` 参数。通常这会导致 1D 网格点数目增加。\\ ``AUTO`` 关键字本质上取决于阈值和参数，这些可通过关键字 "
"``THRSHIFT``\\ 、\\ ``ITMAX``\\ 、\\ ``LEVMAX``\\ 、\\ ``DENSMAX`` 和 "
"``DENSMIN`` 进行控制。"

msgid ""
"**``DENSMAX``\\ =\\ *value*** (=1.d-2 default) Threshold for the maximum "
"vibrational density on the edges of the potential needed for the automated "
"upscaling of the potentials (see keyword ``AUTO``)."
msgstr ""
"**``DENSMAX``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** （默认值为 1.d-2）实现势能自动升尺度所需的势能边缘最大振动密度阈值（参见关键字 "
"``AUTO``\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"**``DENSMIN``\\ =\\ *value*** (=1.d-4 default) Threshold for the minimum "
"vibrational density on the edges of the potential needed for the automated "
"downscaling of the potentials (see keyword ``AUTO``)."
msgstr ""
"**``DENSMIN``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** （默认值为 1.d-4）实现势能自动降尺度所需的势能边缘最小振动密度阈值（参见关键字 "
"``AUTO``\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"**``ITMAX``\\ =\\ *n*** (=10 default) Specifies the maximum number of "
"iterations within the automatic scaling of the potentials (see Keyword "
"``AUTO``)."
msgstr "**``ITMAX``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** （默认值为 10）指定势能自动标度过程中的最大迭代次数（参见关键字 ``AUTO``\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"**``LEVMAX``\\ =\\ *n*** Maximum number of vibrational states to be included"
" for controlling the automated scaling and shifting procedure. The default "
"is set to 5. This value should support subsequent VCI calculations."
msgstr "**``LEVMAX``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 用于控制自动标度与移动过程的振动态最大数目。默认值为 5。该值应能支持后续的 VCI 计算。"

msgid ""
"**``MODE``\\ =\\ *n*** Denotes the normal coordinate to be scaled or "
"shifted."
msgstr "**``MODE``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 表示需要标度或移动的简正坐标。"

msgid ""
"**``SFAC``\\ =\\ *value*** Scaling factor for mode ``MODE``. The default is "
"1.0."
msgstr "**``SFAC``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 模式 ``MODE`` 的标度因子。默认值为 1.0。"

msgid ""
"**``SHIFT``\\ =\\ *n*** Allows to shift the potential with respect to the "
"specified coordinate by *n* or *-n* grid points, respectively. Default: "
"``SHIFT=0``."
msgstr ""
"**``SHIFT``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 允许将势能相对于指定坐标分别移动 *\\ n\\ * 或 *-n* 个网格点。默认值：\\ "
"``SHIFT=0``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"**``SHOW``\\ =\\ *n*** (=0 default) Addition printing within the scaling "
"procedure is switched on by ``SHOW=1``."
msgstr "**``SHOW``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** （默认值为 0）通过 ``SHOW=1`` 开启标度过程中的附加打印输出。"

msgid ""
"**``THRSHIFT``\\ =\\ *value*** Threshold controlling the automated shifting "
"of potentials as obtained from the state densities on the lhs and rhs of the"
" potentials. The default is given as ``THRSHIFT=0.05``."
msgstr ""
"**``THRSHIFT``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 控制势能自动移动的阈值，该阈值基于势能左侧和右侧的态密度获得。默认值为 "
"``THRSHIFT=0.05``\\ 。"

msgid "<!--==== Scaling of individual internal coordinates ===="
msgstr "<!--==== 单个内坐标的标度 ===="

msgid "``SCALIC,options``"
msgstr "``SCALIC,options``"

msgid ""
"**``MIN(n)``\\ =\\ *value*** Defines the minimum :math:`value` of coordinate"
" :math:`n`."
msgstr "**``MIN(n)``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 定义坐标 :math:`n` 的最小 :math:`value`\\ 。"

msgid ""
"**``MAX(n)``\\ =\\ *value*** Defines the maximum :math:`value` of coordinate"
" :math:`n`."
msgstr "**``MAX(n)``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 定义坐标 :math:`n` 的最大 :math:`value`\\ 。"

msgid "-->"
msgstr "-->"

msgid "``FIT,options``"
msgstr "``FIT,options``"

msgid ""
"**``COORD(x)``\\ =\\ *variable*** Defines the fit function for coordinate "
":math:`x`. The possible fit functions are B-splines (*bspline*), Gaussian "
"functions (*gauss*), Morse functions (*morse*), polynomials (*poly*) and "
"trigonometric functions (*trigo*)."
msgstr ""
"**``COORD(x)``\\ =\\ *\\ variable*** 定义坐标 :math:`x` 的拟合函数。可用的拟合函数包括 B 样条（*\\"
" bspline\\ *）、高斯函数（*\\ gauss\\ *）、Morse 函数（*\\ morse\\ *）、多项式（*\\ poly\\ "
"*）和三角函数（*\\ trigo*）。"

msgid ""
"**``FITLABEL``\\ =\\ *variable*** The name of the label defined in the input"
" stream. The label contains the electronic structure level which should be "
"used for the cross-validation."
msgstr "**``FITLABEL``\\ =\\ *\\ variable*** 在输入流中定义的标签名称。该标签包含用于交叉验证的电子结构级别。"

msgid ""
"**``FITMETHOD``\\ =\\ *n*** (=1 Default) Within the iterative build-up of "
"the individual subsurfaces, intermediate fitting will be used. This can be "
"based on true multidimensional Kronecker product fitting (``FITMETHOD``\\ "
"=1) or on fitting along one-dimensional cuts (``FITMETHOD``\\ =2)."
msgstr ""
"**``FITMETHOD``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** （默认值为 1）在各个子势能的迭代构建过程中，将使用中间拟合。这可以基于真正的多维 "
"Kronecker 积拟合（\\ ``FITMETHOD``\\ =1），或基于沿一维切片的拟合（\\ ``FITMETHOD``\\ =2）。"

msgid ""
"**``FITxD``\\ =\\ *n*** The maximum order of the polynomials used for "
"fitting within the iterative interpolation scheme can be controlled by the "
"keywords ``FIT1D, FIT2D, FIT3D, FIT4D``. The default is given by 9. However "
"in certain cases higher values may be necessary, but require an appropriate "
"number of coarse grid points, which can be controlled by ``MIN1D`` etc. (See"
" ``XSURF`` options)"
msgstr ""
"**``FITxD``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 迭代插值方案中用于拟合的多项式的最大阶数可通过关键字 ``FIT1D, FIT2D, FIT3D,"
" FIT4D`` 控制。默认值为 9。然而在某些情况下可能需要更高的值，但这需要适当数量的粗网格点，可通过 ``MIN1D`` 等控制。（参见 "
"``XSURF`` 选项）"

msgid ""
"**``ONLY``\\ =\\ *variable*** Sets one fit function for all coordinates. The"
" possible fit functions are the same as for the option ``COORD``."
msgstr "**``ONLY``\\ =\\ *\\ variable*** 为所有坐标设置一个拟合函数。可用的拟合函数与选项 ``COORD`` 相同。"

msgid "``POINTS,options``"
msgstr "``POINTS,options``"

msgid ""
"**``GPRDERIV``\\ =\\ *n*** (=\\ *2* Default) Up to the dimension *n*, the "
"derivatives obtained by a Gaussian process regression are used to weight the"
" variance."
msgstr "**``GPRDERIV``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** （默认值为 *\\ 2\\ *）直到维度 *\\ n*，由高斯过程回归获得的导数被用于加权方差。"

msgid ""
"**``GPRGRIDxD``\\ =\\ *n***. The number *n* of grid points for which the "
"variance is computed for the dimension **x**. Only odd values are possible. "
"As a default, the maximum number of *ab initio* points is used. (See keyword"
" ``MAXxD``)"
msgstr ""
"**``GPRGRIDxD``\\ =\\ *\\ n***。为维度 **\\ x** 计算方差的网格点数 *\\ n\\ "
"*。仅允许使用奇数值。默认情况下，使用 *\\ ab initio* 点的最大数量。（参见关键字 ``MAXxD``\\ ）"

msgid ""
"**``GPRPRExD``\\ =\\ *n***. For higher dimensions, it is recommended that "
"the variance is not computed for all desired points. Instead a pre-"
"selection, also based on gaussian process regression is used. With this "
"keyword, *n* points are used for the pre-selection of the dimension **x**. "
"Negative values will switch the pre-selection off. For the 1D and 2D, no "
"pre-selection is done by default. The default for higher dimensions is set "
"to 4. Not, that this value has to be considered adequately with respect to "
"the keyword ``GPRGRIDxD``."
msgstr ""
"**``GPRPRExD``\\ =\\ *\\ "
"n***。对于更高维度，建议不要对所有所需点计算方差。而是使用同样基于高斯过程回归的预选。使用此关键字时，*\\ n\\ * 个点用于维度 **x** "
"的预选。负值将关闭预选。对于一维和二维，默认不进行预选。对于更高维度，默认值设为 4。注意，此值必须与关键字 ``GPRGRIDxD`` 适当协调考虑。"

msgid ""
"**``POINT_SCHEME``\\ =\\ *variable*** (=\\ ``NOSHIFT`` Default) The "
"distribution of ab initio points along a coordinate is determined by a fixed"
" point scheme. This distribution has been generated for potentials, which "
"have not been shifted. For strongly shifted potentials, improved point "
"schemes can be used by the option ``POINT_SCHEME``\\ =\\ ``SHIFT``."
msgstr ""
"**``POINT_SCHEME``\\ =\\ *\\ variable*** （默认值为 ``NOSHIFT``\\ "
"）沿坐标的从头算点分布由固定点方案确定。此分布是针对未移动的势能生成的。对于强烈移动的势能，可通过选项 ``POINT_SCHEME``\\ =\\ "
"``SHIFT`` 使用改进的点方案。"

msgid ""
"**``TYPE``\\ =\\ *variable*** (=\\ *fix* Default) In the case ``TYPE=gpr``, "
"the variance obtained by a Gaussian process regression is used to determine "
"new points were the energy as to be computed."
msgstr ""
"**``TYPE``\\ =\\ *\\ variable*** （默认值为 *\\ fix*）在 ``TYPE=gpr`` "
"的情况下，使用由高斯过程回归获得的方差来确定需要计算能量的新点。"

msgid "``VFREQ,options``"
msgstr "``VFREQ,options``"

msgid ""
"Usually, the displacements vectors of the normal coordinates are retrieved "
"from a preceding harmonic frequency calculation called by the ``FREQ`` "
"program. Alternatively, these vectors can be obtained from the ``XSURF`` "
"program and the ``VFREQ`` directive. However, this alternative is solely "
"based on a twofold numerical differentiation and does not take advantage out"
" of analytical derivatives. However it offers a couple of options, which are"
" not available in the ``FREQ`` program."
msgstr ""
"通常，简正坐标的位移矢量来自先前由 ``FREQ`` 程序调用的谐频计算。或者，这些矢量可以从 ``XSURF`` 程序和 ``VFREQ`` "
"指令获得。然而，此替代方案仅基于二次数值微分，并未利用解析导数。但它提供了一些 ``FREQ`` 程序中不可用的选项。"

msgid ""
"**``COORD``\\ =\\ *n*** (=2 Default) Symmetry adapted coordinates, "
"``COORD``\\ =1, or Cartesian coordinates, ``COORD``\\ =2, may be used within"
" the numerical differentiation."
msgstr ""
"**``COORD``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** （默认值为 2）在数值微分中可以使用对称性适配坐标，\\ ``COORD``\\ "
"=1，或笛卡尔坐标，\\ ``COORD``\\ =2。"

msgid ""
"**``METHOD``\\ =\\ *n*** (=1 Default) This option specifies the number of "
"points within the numerical differentiation, i.e. ``METHOD``\\ =1 refers to "
"the standard 3-point formula (central differences), ``METHOD``\\ =2 denotes "
"the more accurate 5-point formula and ``METHOD``\\ =3 the 7-point formula."
msgstr ""
"**``METHOD``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** （默认值为 1）此选项指定数值微分中的点数，即 ``METHOD``\\ =1 "
"指标准的三点公式（中心差分），\\ ``METHOD``\\ =2 表示更精确的五点公式，\\ ``METHOD``\\ =3 表示七点公式。"

msgid "**``PRINT``\\ =\\ *n*** (=1 Default) Printout control."
msgstr "**``PRINT``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** （默认值为 1）打印输出控制。"

msgid ""
"**``START``\\ =\\ *label*** This sets the label in the input stream to "
"determine the electronic structure level to be used."
msgstr "**``START``\\ =\\ *\\ label*** 该选项设置输入流中的标签，以确定要使用的电子结构级别。"

msgid ""
"**``STEP``\\ =\\ *value*** (=1.0d-2 Default) This option specifies the step "
"width within the numerical differentiation."
msgstr "**``STEP``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** （默认值 =1.0d-2）此选项指定数值微分中的步长。"

msgid "``GRAPH,options``"
msgstr "``GRAPH,options``"

msgid ""
"**``DIRECTORY``\\ =\\ *path*** (=./plots1 Default) Path or name of the "
"directory to be specified for dumping the files for visualisation. See the "
"keyword ``NDIM``."
msgstr ""
"**``DIRECTORY``\\ =\\ *\\ path*** （默认值 =./plots1）为可视化文件转储指定路径或目录名。参见关键字 "
"``NDIM``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"**``MOLDEN``\\ =\\ *file name*** This allows to dump a file, which can "
"directly read in by the Molden or Wxmacmolplot programs. This allows for the"
" visualisation of the geometry and the harmonic frequencies of the molecule."
msgstr ""
"**``MOLDEN``\\ =\\ *\\ file name*** 允许转储一个文件，该文件可直接被 Molden 或 Wxmacmolplot "
"程序读取。这允许对分子的几何结构和简谐频率进行可视化。"

msgid ""
"**``NDIM``\\ =\\ *n*** (=0 Default) This keyword writes all *n*\\ D surfaces"
" and a corresponding Gnuplot script in a separate subdirectory (``plots1``) "
"in the *home*-directory in order to allow for visualization of the computed "
"*n*\\ D surfaces. E.g. the command \"gnuplot plotV1D.gnu\" in the ``plots1``"
" directory produces .eps files for all 1D surfaces."
msgstr ""
"**``NDIM``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** （默认值 =0）该关键字将全部 *\\ n\\ *\\D 势能面及相应的 Gnuplot 脚本写入 "
"*\\ home\\ * 目录下的一个单独子目录（``plots1``）中，以便对计算得到的 *\\ n*\\D 势能面进行可视化。例如，在 "
"``plots1`` 目录中执行命令 “gnuplot plotV1D.gnu” 会为所有一维势能面生成 .eps 文件。"

msgid "``REPAR,options``"
msgstr "``REPAR,options``"

msgid ""
"**``ITMAX1D``\\ =\\ *n*** The maximum number of iterations in the local "
"optimization of the semiempirical parameters can be controlled by "
"``ITMAX1D`` and ``ITMAX2D``. The defaults are ``ITMAX1D``\\ =100 and "
"``ITMAX2D``\\ =150."
msgstr ""
"**``ITMAX1D``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 半经验参数局部优化中的最大迭代次数可通过 ``ITMAX1D`` 和 ``ITMAX2D`` "
"控制。默认值为 ``ITMAX1D``\\ =100 和 ``ITMAX2D``\\ =150。"

msgid ""
"**``RMS1D``\\ =\\ *value*** The keywords ``RMS1D`` and ``RMS2D`` specify the"
" threshold for terminating the 1D and 2D iterations in the local "
"optimization of the semiempirical parameters. The defaults are given by "
"``RMS1D``\\ =1.d-6 and ``RMS2D``\\ =1.d-6."
msgstr ""
"**``RMS1D``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 关键字 ``RMS1D`` 和 ``RMS2D`` "
"指定半经验参数局部优化中一维和二维迭代的终止阈值。默认值为 ``RMS1D``\\ =1.d-6 和 ``RMS2D``\\ =1.d-6。"

msgid "``ALTER,options``"
msgstr "``ALTER,options``"

msgid "**``NEW``\\ =\\ *label*** Specification of the new label."
msgstr "**``NEW``\\ =\\ *\\ label*** 指定新标签。"

msgid "**``OLD``\\ =\\ *label*** Specification of the old label."
msgstr "**``OLD``\\ =\\ *\\ label*** 指定旧标签。"

msgid "``DELETE,surface labels``"
msgstr "``DELETE,surface labels``"

msgid ""
"The ``DELETE`` directive allows to eliminate individual surfaces within the "
"multi-mode expansion of the potential. Unlike the ``SKIP`` keyword, this "
"directive can only be used once a calculation is restarted from a completed "
"potential energy surface calculation. This directive is meant for studying "
"the impact of individual surfaces or to eliminate troublesome surfaces, "
"which failed to converge in the iterative fitting procedure."
msgstr ""
"``DELETE`` 指令允许在势能的多模展开中消除单个势能面。与 ``SKIP`` "
"关键字不同，该指令只能在从已完成的势能面计算重新启动计算后使用。该指令旨在研究单个势能面的影响，或消除在迭代拟合过程中未能收敛的棘手势能面。"

msgid "``VIBMODE,options``"
msgstr "``VIBMODE,options``"

msgid ""
"**``ENERGHIGH``\\ =\\ *value*** Modes with a frequency lower than **value** "
"are used to span the surface (according to the harmonic frequencies)"
msgstr "**``ENERGHIGH``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 频率低于 **\\ value** 的模式用于展开势能面（依据简谐频率）"

msgid ""
"**``ENERGLOW``\\ =\\ *value*** Modes with a frequency higher than **value** "
"are used to span the surface (according to the harmonic frequencies)"
msgstr "**``ENERGLOW``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 频率高于 **\\ value** 的模式用于展开势能面（依据简谐频率）"

msgid ""
"**``HIGH``\\ =\\ *n*** the highest **n** modes are used to span the surface"
msgstr "**``HIGH``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 最高的 **\\ n** 个模式用于展开势能面"

msgid "**``LOW``\\ =\\ *n*** the lowest **n** modes are used to span the surface"
msgstr "**``LOW``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 最低的 **\\ n** 个模式用于展开势能面"

msgid ""
"**``MODE``\\ =\\ *n*** Mode which is used to span the surface (can be used "
"multiple times)"
msgstr "**``MODE``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 用于展开势能面的模式（可多次使用）"

msgid "``INTERFACE,options``"
msgstr "``INTERFACE,options``"

msgid ""
"**``DATA``\\ =\\ *n*** (=1 Default) ``DATA=1`` provides detailed information"
" about each single point of the PES in a formatted output. ``DATA=2`` "
"provides the geometry and energy of a given point in a single line. New "
"information about this point needs to be added at the end of the line. "
"``DATA=2`` prints the displacements along the coordinates and the energy in "
"a single line. Again, new information needs to be added at the end of this "
"line."
msgstr ""
"**``DATA``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** （默认值 =1）\\ ``DATA=1`` 以格式化输出提供关于 PES 每个单点的详细信息。\\ "
"``DATA=2`` 以单行形式提供给定点的几何结构和能量。关于该点的新信息需添加在该行末尾。\\ ``DATA=2`` "
"在单行中打印沿坐标的位移和能量。同样，新信息需添加在该行末尾。"

msgid "**``FILE``\\ =\\ *file name*** Specifies the name of the external file."
msgstr "**``FILE``\\ =\\ *\\ file name*** 指定外部文件的名称。"

msgid ""
"**``NDIM``\\ =\\ *n*** (=0 Default) Dimension of the :math:`n`-mode "
"expansion to which the geometry information shall be dumped."
msgstr "**``NDIM``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** （默认值 =0）几何信息应转储到的 :math:`n` 模展开的维度。"

msgid ""
"**``SURFACE``\\ =\\ *n*** (=0 Default) Information about the energy values "
"printed in the external file. ``SURFACE=0`` refers to absolute energies "
"(minus the reference energy), while ``SURFACE=1`` refers to energy "
"differences belonging to the individual increments of the subsurfaces."
msgstr ""
"**``SURFACE``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** （默认值 =0）关于外部文件中打印的能量值的信息。\\ ``SURFACE=0`` "
"指绝对能量（减去参考能量），而 ``SURFACE=1`` 指属于子势能面各增量的能量差。"

msgid ""
"**``ZERO``\\ =\\ *n*** (=1 Default) If set to 1, geometries of lower orders "
"of the :math:`n`-mode representation will be printed, i.e. the external file"
" contains redundant data. ``ZERO=0`` neglects all redundancies and prints "
"only unique points. As a consequence, an external file generated this way "
"cannot be read in again for technical reasons."
msgstr ""
"**``ZERO``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** （默认值 =1）若设为 1，将打印 :math:`n` "
"模表示中较低阶的几何结构，即外部文件包含冗余数据。\\ ``ZERO=0`` "
"忽略所有冗余，仅打印唯一点。因此，由于技术原因，以这种方式生成的外部文件无法再次读取。"

msgid "``XGRIDCOMP,options``"
msgstr "``XGRIDCOMP,options``"

msgid ""
"The ``GRIDCOMP`` directive of the ``XSURF`` program allows to interface "
"Molpro with a grid computing client such as Segl. It is also possible to use"
" the grid computing interface without any grid computing client by using "
"scripts, which will automatically been generated within the individual calls"
" of ``XGRIDCOMP``. The charge of the molecule as well as some other general "
"commands are transferred to the individual grid point command files, which "
"are printed out in the subdirectory points. If there are any doubts whether "
"the specified command is transferred to the single point or not, the command"
" should be given within the definition of the electronic structure "
"calculations. Note, grid computing is needed is very special cases, when the"
" standard \"XSURF\" procedure shall be bypassed."
msgstr ""
"``XSURF`` 程序的 ``GRIDCOMP`` 指令允许 Molpro 与网格计算客户端（如 "
"Segl）对接。也可以不使用任何网格计算客户端而使用网格计算接口，方法是使用在 ``XGRIDCOMP`` "
"的各次调用中自动生成的脚本。分子的电荷以及一些其他常规命令被传送到各个网格点命令文件中，这些文件打印在子目录 points "
"中。若对指定命令是否传送到单点存有任何疑问，应在电子结构计算的定义中给出该命令。注意，在需要绕过标准 “XSURF” "
"过程的非常特殊的情况下，才需要网格计算。"

msgid ""
"**``CORES``\\ =\\ *n*** Number of cores to be used within the grid "
"computing."
msgstr "**``CORES``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 网格计算中使用的核心数。"

msgid ""
"**``FILE``\\ =\\ *n*** (n=1..2) specifies the file number of the Molpro "
"\\*.wfu file (see the ``FILE`` command of Molpro)."
msgstr ""
"**``FILE``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** （n=1..2）指定 Molpro \\*.wfu 文件的文件编号（参见 Molpro 的 "
"``FILE`` 命令）。"

msgid ""
"**``LOOP``\\ =\\ *n*** When processing the batches of single point "
"calculations, the grid computing interface needs to know, if it is the very "
"first batch (``LOOP``\\ =0), in which just input files for Molpro will be "
"generated or if it is one of the subsequent batches (``LOOP``\\ =1), in "
"which also the outputs of processed single point calculations need to be "
"read in."
msgstr ""
"**``LOOP``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 在处理批量单点计算时，网格计算接口需要知道这是否是第一批（\\ ``LOOP``\\ "
"=0），此时仅生成 Molpro 的输入文件；或者这是否是后续批次之一（\\ ``LOOP``\\ =1），此时还需要读入已处理的单点计算的输出。"

msgid ""
"**``MEMORY``\\ =\\ *n*** Denotes the amount of memory (in MW) which is "
"needed in each single point calculation. The default is given by 100 MW."
msgstr "**``MEMORY``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 表示每个单点计算所需的内存量（以 MW 为单位）。默认值为 100 MW。"

msgid ""
"**``WFU``\\ =\\ *file name*** If additional information need to be read in "
"from a .wfu file, this can be specified here."
msgstr "**``WFU``\\ =\\ *\\ file name*** 如果需要从 .wfu 文件中读入附加信息，可在此处指定。"

msgid "``VADD,options``"
msgstr "``VADD,options``"

msgid ""
"In practice one may come to the conclusion that the :math:`n`-mode expansion"
" of an existing potential has been truncated too early and one needs to "
"extend the order. Once the level of the electronic structure calculations "
"shall not be changed between the highest existing order and the one to be "
"added, one can simply restart the calculation from the existing restart file"
" by increasing the option ``NDIM`` in the input stream. However, if one "
"needs to alter the electronic structure level, the ``VADD`` directive needs "
"to be used."
msgstr ""
"在实践中可能会得出这样的结论：对现有势能的 :math:`n` "
"模式展开截断过早，需要扩展阶数。只要在最高现有阶数与待增加阶数之间不改变电子结构计算的级别，就可以通过增大输入流中的选项 ``NDIM`` "
"从现有重启文件简单地重启计算。然而，如果需要改变电子结构级别，则必须使用 ``VADD`` 指令。"

msgid ""
"**``START``\\ =\\ *label*** Specification of the label for the order to be "
"added."
msgstr "**``START``\\ =\\ *\\ label*** 指定待增加阶数的标签。"

msgid ""
"**``QCOORD``\\ =\\ *variable*** (=POT Default) This option specifies from "
"where to take the displacement vectors for the normal coordinates. By "
"default they are taken from the external restart file, but ``QCOORD``\\ =\\ "
"*FREQ* allows to take them from a new harmonic frequency calculation."
msgstr ""
"**``QCOORD``\\ =\\ *\\ variable*** （=POT "
"默认值）此选项指定从何处获取简正坐标的位移矢量。默认从外部重启文件获取，但 ``QCOORD``\\ =\\ *\\ FREQ* "
"允许从新的谐频计算中获取。"

msgid "``CHECK,options``"
msgstr "``CHECK,options``"

msgid ""
"**``NDIM``\\ =\\ *n*** Denotes the level to be checked, i.e. 1 corresponds "
"to 1D, etc. Note, levels below :math:`n` will not be checked automatically."
msgstr ""
"**``NDIM``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 表示待检查的级别，即 1 对应 1D，以此类推。注意，低于 :math:`n` 的级别不会自动检查。"

msgid ""
"**``POINTSxD``\\ =\\ *value*** Determines the number of grid points in one "
"dimension to be checked. The default is set to 4."
msgstr "**``POINTSxD``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 确定一维中待检查的网格点数目。默认设为 4。"

msgid "``EXTRADATA,options``"
msgstr "``EXTRADATA,options``"

msgid ""
"**``NDIM``\\ =\\ *n*** Dimension of the :math:`n`-mode expansion to be used "
"for the new property."
msgstr "**``NDIM``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 用于新性质的 :math:`n` 模式展开的维数。"

msgid "**``NEL``\\ =\\ *n*** Number of data to be read in for one point."
msgstr "**``NEL``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 每个点需读入的数据数目。"

msgid ""
"**``VARx``\\ =\\ *variable*** (x=number) Name of the variable, which shall "
"be read from the input file."
msgstr "**``VARx``\\ =\\ *\\ variable*** （x=数字）变量的名称，该变量将从输入文件中读取。"

msgid "<!--==== Internal Coordinates ===="
msgstr "<!--==== Internal Coordinates ===="

msgid "``INTC,options``"
msgstr "``INTC,options``"

msgid "**``TYPE``\\ =\\ *variable*** Type of internal Coordinate. **variable=**"
msgstr "**``TYPE``\\ =\\ *\\ variable*** 内坐标的类型。**\\ variable=**"

msgid ""
"**``ECKART``\\ =\\ *n*** If :math:`n=1`, the geometry is rotated according "
"to the eckart conditions which is recommended for the use of other "
"properties than the energy"
msgstr ""
"**``ECKART``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 如果 :math:`n=1`\\ ，则根据 Eckart "
"条件旋转几何结构，当使用能量以外的其他性质时推荐使用"

msgid ""
"**``NDIMGMAT``\\ =\\ *n*** Determines the order of the expansion of the "
"Wilson G matrix. Higher than dimension 2 is not recommended"
msgstr "**``NDIMGMAT``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 确定 Wilson G 矩阵展开的阶数。不建议高于 2 维"

msgid ""
"**``NDIMVG``\\ =\\ *n***. Determines the order of the expansion of the "
"Pseudopotential. Higher than the dimension 2 is not recommended"
msgstr "**``NDIMVG``\\ =\\ *\\ n***。确定赝势展开的阶数。不建议高于 2 维"

msgid ""
"**``RADII``\\ =\\ *x*** :math:`x` is the threshold for detecting a bon "
"between two atoms"
msgstr "**``RADII``\\ =\\ *\\ x*** :math:`x` 是检测两个原子之间成键的阈值"

msgid ""
"**``CUTOFF``\\ =\\ *x*** :math:`x` is the threshold for detecting clusters "
"(not useable currently)"
msgstr "**``CUTOFF``\\ =\\ *\\ x*** :math:`x` 是检测簇的阈值（目前不可用）"

msgid ""
"**``THRGEOM``\\ =\\ *x*** Threshold to determine if the geometry is "
"converged"
msgstr "**``THRGEOM``\\ =\\ *\\ x*** 判断几何结构是否收敛的阈值"

msgid ""
"**``ITMAX``\\ =\\ *n*** Defines the maximum number of iteration when "
"elongate the geometries"
msgstr "**``ITMAX``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 定义拉伸几何结构时的最大迭代次数"

msgid ""
"**``PSCRLAB``\\ =\\ *label*** Defines a label for precomputing the surface "
"to determine a first scaling"
msgstr "**``PSCRLAB``\\ =\\ *\\ label*** 定义用于预计算表面以确定首次缩放的标签"

msgid ""
"**``ELONG``\\ =\\ *n*** Defines different ways on how to compute the "
"elongations within the backtransformation from internal to Cartesian "
"coordinates"
msgstr "**``ELONG``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 定义在内坐标向笛卡尔坐标反变换过程中计算拉伸的不同方式"

msgid ""
"For Z-Matrix based coordinates it can be either a simple "
"construction(:math:`n=0`) or the HOPE algorithm (:math:`n=1`)"
msgstr "对于基于 Z-Matrix 的坐标，可以是简单构造（\\ :math:`n=0`\\ ）或 HOPE 算法（\\ :math:`n=1`\\ ）"

msgid ""
"For NatInt coordinates it can either be a standard B matrix algorithm "
"(:math:`n=0`), virtuel geometries (:math:`n=1`) or subsequent elongation of "
"single coordinates (:math:`n=3`)"
msgstr ""
"对于 NatInt 坐标，可以是标准 B 矩阵算法（\\ :math:`n=0`\\ ）、虚拟几何结构（\\ :math:`n=1`\\ "
"）或单个坐标的后续拉伸（\\ :math:`n=3`\\ ）"

msgid ""
"**``VAM``\\ =\\ *n*** If :math:`n=1`, rovibrational coupling is considered "
"when the G-matrix is computed-->"
msgstr "**``VAM``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 如果 :math:`n=1`\\ ，则在计算 G 矩阵时考虑振转耦合-->"

msgid "<!--"
msgstr "<!--"

msgid "``SURF,options``"
msgstr "``SURF,options``"

msgid ""
"The old ``SURF`` program for generating potential energy surfaces is still "
"implemented, but is no longer supported. Several keywords are specific to "
"the ``XSURF`` core and cannot be used together with ``SURF``. The new and "
"much improved ``XSURF`` code follows the same philosophy and many options "
"are the same as in the old ``SURF`` code, but ``XSURF`` cannot read any "
"potential files being generated by ``SURF``. If you need to use the old "
"``SURF`` program, see older versions of the manual for the corresponding "
"keywords. -->"
msgstr ""
"用于生成势能面的旧版 ``SURF`` 程序仍然实现，但已不再受支持。若干关键字是 ``XSURF`` 内核特有的，无法与 ``SURF`` "
"一起使用。全新的、经过大幅改进的 ``XSURF`` 代码遵循相同的理念，许多选项与旧版 ``SURF`` 代码相同，但 ``XSURF`` 无法读取由"
" ``SURF`` 生成的任何势文件。如果需要使用旧版 ``SURF`` 程序，请参阅较旧版本手册中相应的关键字。 -->"
